/malikrajat/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/malikrajat","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/malikrajat/rm-carousel/commits/0d6bd2488adc90348946ede9750e299b4d396057/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-13T16:48:26Z","email":"11173135+malikrajat@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Rajat"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-13T16:48:26Z","email":"11173135+malikrajat@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Rajat"},"message":"Release v5.0.0: Angular 22 & standalone signals\n\nMajor release preparing v5.0.0: upgrade to Angular 22 and modernize the library. Key changes: bump package to 5.0.0; rebuild fesm2022 bundle to use input signals, OnPush, improved Ken-Burns transitions, safer autoplay/transition timers, and a standalone RmCarousel class/API; add types/rm-carousel.d.ts; remove old index.d.ts; add CHANGELOG, LICENSE and demo asset; large README overhaul; update .gitignore and .npmignore; update package metadata/peerDependencies/exports. This introduces breaking changes (signals/standalone component and Angular 22 minimum).","tree":{"sha":"777e6dc78c2d9b1cfb51849c6f6b65ff5ace3c6a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/malikrajat/rm-carousel/git/trees/777e6dc78c2d9b1cfb51849c6f6b65ff5ace3c6a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/malikrajat/rm-carousel/git/commits/0d6bd2488adc90348946ede9750e299b4d396057","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11173135?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/malikrajat/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/malikrajat/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/malikrajat/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/malikrajat/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/malikrajat","id":11173135,"login":"malikrajat","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMT