ed.\n\n* fix(logger): retry retained storage batches\n\nRetry batches kept in _savingLogs during explicit save and download flows so preserved failures are flushed before pruning or exporting logs.\n\n* fix(logger): remove time key collisions\n\n* test(logger): add browser verification harness","tree":{"sha":"e1b30d096e1291d58ad043ddb9b9db99a7cfd9ec","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ringcentral/ringcentral-mfe/git/trees/e1b30d096e1291d58ad043ddb9b9db99a7cfd9ec"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ringcentral/ringcentral-mfe/git/commits/e257c2e4a672467b5fbc91cee7a666f93e720530","verification":{"payload":"tree e1b30d096e1291d58ad043ddb9b9db99a7cfd9ec\nparent 81d892726e1ad89d60bd27c46df6a2a6e9a3e579\nauthor Michael Lin <unadlib@gmail.com> 1776325560 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1776325560 +0800\n\nfix(logger): harden storage transport persistence (#32)\n\n* fix(logger): harden storage transport persistence\n\n* fix(logger): preserve failed storage batches\n\n* fix(logger): preserve queued storage batches\n\nTrack batches as soon as they are queued so unload temp persistence captures writes waiting behind an in-flight save. Also keep download log export failures explicit by requiring the pre-export flush to succeed.\n\n* fix(logger): retry retained storage batches\n\nRetry batches kept in _savingLogs during explicit save and download flows so preserved failures are flushed before pruning or exporting logs.\n\n* fix(logger): remove time key collisions\n\n* test(logger): add browser verification harness","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJp4JO4CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAbJUQAJiZoIu052q0sBmaPtu9qGtq\nTF1rEOKeqgD1iu4uA1RmYryarYYxhb+k+jMlD59Km4PNP4lza+6WHAsvREVcjNQx\nYa/7YMtQWc5CL/5aJ6wq+tgFsM2G0Wv0zJjDHGY8InQu3SfMdjTVekhYREMKGwa8\njQsTHWQ0XMRJD3W2YKvtey/XlPhUM/JgEJiEaM2GYlLSx5+hWw1X4WMtiIfjWz8v\nLqGmUYq/PR8lAcvp0bKqGpnKF/xFabtDxsCIiQkRI+vWQLHoBWBzuAXpZ5/iL2gK\nGir7/Ihr61bTcqdQ8PpyBvqzvmIcixkX6mlLJFOhkrI+bYjCfWkqcT8cZkt7nfA