DQ6VXNlcjc3OTQzODc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gkrajniak/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gkrajniak/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gkrajniak/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gkrajniak/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gkrajniak/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gkrajniak","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmfp/portal/commits/44dde4f06acbffcd7d7da6c1ac4eee625dc80952/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T11:11:34Z","email":"gkrajniak@gmail.com","name":"Grzegorz Krajniak"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T11:11:34Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(deps): bump portal libraries and resolve vulnerabilities (#756)\n\n## Summary\n\nPicks up the portal library releases with the dependency vulnerability fixes (openmfp/portal-ui-lib#736, openmfp/portal-server-lib#378) and resolves the remaining Dependabot alerts and `npm audit` findings.\n\n## Portal libraries\n\n- @openmfp/portal-ui-lib `^0.195.11` → `^0.197.6` (frontend)\n- @openmfp/portal-server-lib 0.164.18 → 0.165.1 (backend)\n\n## Frontend lockfile updates (re-resolving Angular within `^22.0.0`)\n\n- @angular/core, router and the other framework packages 22.1.2 → 22.2.1 (GHSA-ff3f-86qr-9cv3)\n- @angular/build, @angular/cli 22.1.4 → 22.2.2, which brings piscina 5.2.0 → 5.3.2\n- @modelcontextprotocol/sdk 1.30.0 removed (@angular/cli 22.2.2 uses @modelcontextprotocol/server), dropping proxy-addr 2.0.7 and ip-address 10.5.0\n- source-map-js 1.2.1 → 1.2.2\n- brace-expansion 2.1.4 → 2.1.7, 5.0.9 → 5.0.12\n\n## Backend lockfile updates (`npm audit fix`)\n\n- axios 1.19.0 → 1.20.0\n- ip-address 10.5.0 → 10.7.3\n- proxy-addr 2.0.7 → 2.0.8\n- brace-expansion 1.1.18 → 1.1.21, 2.1.4 → 2.1.7, 5.0.9 → 5.0.12\n\n## Root override\n\n- shell-quote 1.9.0 → 1.12.0 via `overrides` (`^1.11.0`, GHSA-pqg4-j6r4-53mv); concurrently pins shell-quote 1.9.0 exactly\n\n## Not fixable\n\nNo patched version is published yet:\n- braces 3.0.3 (GHSA-vfj7-8cjw-p6xm), frontend and backend, dev only\n- sprintf-js 1.0.3 (GHSA-hp3w-g68c-fv3c), backend, dev only\n\n## Verification\n\nRoot `npm ci` (which installs `frontend/` and `backend/` through `prepare`, as CI and the Dockerfile do), `npm run build` and `npm test` pass. The repository has no unit tests (backend jest finds none, the frontend test script is a stub).\n\nOn-behalf-of: @SAP grzegorz.krajniak@sap.com\n\nSigned-off-by: renovate[bot] <29139614+renovate[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: renovate[bot] <29139614+renovate[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"725da6d168b5cf705db82d4f983089d41dd21df9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmfp/portal/git/trees/725da6d168b5cf705db82d4f983089d41dd21df9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmfp/portal/git/commits/44dde4f06acbffcd7d7da6c1ac4eee625dc80952","verification":{"payload":"tree 725da6d168b5cf705db82d4f983089d41dd21df9\nparent 3f840555c3d0e0b7b3068a3ffe1b379654388cf5\nauthor Grzegorz Krajniak <gkrajniak@gmail.com> 1791371494 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791371494 +0200\n\nfix(deps): bump portal libraries and resolve vulnerabilities (#756)\n\n## Summary\n\nPicks up the portal library releases with the dependency vulnerability fixes (openmfp/portal-ui-lib#736, openmfp/portal-server-lib#378) and resolves the remaining Dependabot alerts and `npm audit` findings.\n\n## Portal libraries\n\n- @openmfp/portal-ui-lib `^0.195.11` → `^0.197.6` (frontend)\n- @openmfp/portal-server-lib 0.164.18 → 0.165.1 (backend)\n\n## Frontend lockfile updates (re-resolving Angular within `^22.0.0`)\n\n- @angular/core, router and the other framework packages 22.1.2 → 22.2.1 (GHSA-ff3f-86qr-9cv3)\n- @angular/build, @angular/cli 22.1.4 → 22.2.2, which brings piscina 5.2.0 → 5.3.2\n- @modelcontextprotocol/sdk 1.30.0 removed (@angular/cli 22.2.2 uses @modelcontextprotocol/server), dropping proxy-addr 2.0.7 and ip-address 10.5.0\n- source-map-js 1.2.1 → 1.2.2\n- brace-expansion 2.1.4 → 2.1.7, 5.0.9 → 5.0.12\n\n## Backend lockfile updates (`npm audit fix`)\n\n- axios 1.19.0 → 1.20.0\n- ip-address 10.5.0 → 10.7.3\n- proxy-addr 2.0.7 → 2.0.8\n- brace-expansion 1.1.18 → 1.1.21, 2.1.4 → 2.1.7, 5.0.9 → 5.0.12\n\n## Root override\n\n- shell-quote 1.9.0 → 1.12.0 via `overrides` (`^1.11.0`, GHSA-pqg4-j6r4-53mv); concurrently pins shell-quote 1.9.0 exactly\n\n## Not fixable\n\nNo patched version is published yet:\n- braces 3.0.3 (GHSA-vfj7-8cjw-p6xm), frontend and backend, dev only\n- sprintf-js 1.0.3 (GHSA-hp3w-g68c-fv3c), backend, dev only\n\n## Verification\n\nRoot `npm ci` (which installs `frontend/` and `backend/` through `prepare`, as CI and the Dockerfile do), `npm run build` and `npm test` pass. The repository has no unit tests (backend jest finds none, the frontend test script is a stub).\n\nOn-behalf-of: @SAP grzegorz.krajniak@sap.com\n\nSigned-off-by: renovate[bot] <29139614+renovate[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: renovate[bot] <29139614+renovate[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxijmCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAqOMQAAbl7p0k3naOUteziTuxZhUg\nggnl3Gj38idUupjzkWL1X4EgFrJLCXYPXwp/zxJnCK3vyJOjf8TL83UOqgsefoso\n583YYlgTXIwRrE3hfRDGNcpTumACakdqav0Vw2APqsw+6YcNAM5Ng11vUwJZy3tS\nwjNNPFxjHG2S0uE4KHOisXhvp4eJu4bKovNmzye8VwPe1PP+mSY2kEyFuz9mvFZz\nQ31zIFzC5KlmsTs9n6QM2T9dd1IslwqjkVDCZbIQJ1G1aIfiDqpef3lwlbxYLQGL\nbzkKq+/Ww3js/ILrOmkpyEZQbMAmf6BKiSX4AyThZdp5mTsYkABYrajN+6Totn/i\nJICYSg/qxLcR5d4dNiCJMSjlPcaJymFPeqMtZ6vXqyEC5nLbTAvSYBRIq/Z4niPG\nEKTdEUotTGqeEAoFty2LzD7woPATEIyKD4ByVNeZft/QrI8nAosqzf7kBOMfSvx7\nXtEypXC3k/QU+fNSN5aWmqAby2Rosop27ly2WHWa/FlxKQUNzqq3MC8VBubCo5oe\ntjmNu2UqCDddINUHZjReuw2jxdoUGgUHY0uqT+NIC6Bo2kSKMq+AJta8IGpSdVqC\ngUqNwL5CwHRA30NnEnmO4ktNQGO4UJC3bcOwMSv7x7OndHPajzsI7CddPV4Vwsd3\nn7jR09+wISu