 backend builds pass. The repository has no unit tests\n(backend jest finds none, frontend test script is a stub).\n\nOn-behalf-of: @SAP grzegorz.krajniak@sap.com\n\nSigned-off-by: gkrajniak <gkrajniak@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"1efa9a0fea21a2e86843ae84ae38e1a4994c6fbc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmfp/portal/git/trees/1efa9a0fea21a2e86843ae84ae38e1a4994c6fbc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmfp/portal/git/commits/3f840555c3d0e0b7b3068a3ffe1b379654388cf5","verification":{"payload":"tree 1efa9a0fea21a2e86843ae84ae38e1a4994c6fbc\nparent ed9e8bf5dcd18d8662a5ac5a38c55d63a7f42141\nauthor Grzegorz Krajniak <gkrajniak@gmail.com> 1789639557 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789639557 +0200\n\nfix(deps): bump portal libraries and resolve vulnerabilities (#754)\n\nPortal libraries:\n- @openmfp/portal-ui-lib 0.194.27 → 0.195.11 (latest release)\n- @openmfp/portal-server-lib 0.164.16 → 0.164.18, which includes the\n  dependency vulnerability fixes from openmfp/portal-server-lib#376\n\nFrontend lockfile updates (`npm audit fix`):\n- fast-uri 3.1.5 → 3.1.8\n- hono 4.13.2 → 4.13.8\n- qs 6.15.3 → 6.16.0\n\nBackend lockfile updates (`npm audit fix`):\n- @nestjs/core, @nestjs/platform-express 11.1.29 → 11.2.5,\n  @nestjs/testing 11.1.8 → 11.2.5\n- @nestjs/common 11.1.29 → 11.2.5, aligned with @nestjs/core, which requires\n  it at runtime\n- fast-uri 3.1.5 → 3.1.8\n- js-yaml 3.15.1 → 3.15.2 and 4.3.1 → 4.3.2\n- qs 6.15.3 → 6.16.0\n- @humanfs/node 0.16.7 → 0.16.8\n\nBackend override:\n- multer 2.2.0 → 2.4.0 via `overrides`; @nestjs/platform-express 11.2.5 pins\n  multer 2.2.0 exactly, and the override in portal-server-lib does not apply\n  to consumers\n\nVerified: npm audit reports 0 vulnerabilities in the root, frontend and\nbackend; frontend and backend builds pass. The repository has no unit tests\n(backend jest finds none, frontend test script is a stub).\n\nOn-behalf-of: @SAP grzegorz.krajniak@sap.com\n\nSigned-off-by: gkrajniak <gkrajniak@gmail.co