A2OGEzZmZlMWIzNzk2NTQzODhjZjU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/openmfp/portal/commit/ed9e8bf5dcd18d8662a5ac5a38c55d63a7f42141","sha":"ed9e8bf5dcd18d8662a5ac5a38c55d63a7f42141","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmfp/portal/commits/ed9e8bf5dcd18d8662a5ac5a38c55d63a7f42141"}],"sha":"3f840555c3d0e0b7b3068a3ffe1b379654388cf5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmfp/portal/commits/3f840555c3d0e0b7b3068a3ffe1b379654388cf5"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7794387?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gkrajniak/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gkrajniak/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gkrajniak/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gkrajniak/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gkrajniak","id":7794387,"login":"gkrajniak","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc3OTQzODc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gkrajniak/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gkrajniak/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gkrajniak/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gkrajniak/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gkrajniak/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gkrajniak","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmfp/portal/commits/ed9e8bf5dcd18d8662a5ac5a38c55d63a7f42141/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-17T09:17:56Z","email":"gkrajniak@gmail.com","name":"Grzegorz Krajniak"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-17T09:17:56Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: angular 22 migration (#752)\n\n* feat: migrate frontend to Angular 22, fix vulnerabilities, bump openmfp libs\n\nMigrate the portal frontend to Angular 22 and upgrade both OpenMFP libraries\nto their latest releases, then clear all npm audit findings across the three\nprojects (root, backend, frontend).\n\nFrontend — Angular 20 -> 22:\n- Bump all @angular/* packages and the build toolchain (@angular/build,\n  @angular/cli, @angular/compiler-cli) to ^22, and TypeScript to ~6.0\n  (required by Angular 22''s build pipeline).\n- Update tsconfig to modern resolution (module \"preserve\",\n  moduleResolution \"bundler\") to satisfy TS 6.0 (node10 resolution is\n  removed in TS 7 and now errors).\n- @openmfp/portal-ui-lib 0.186.15 -> 0.194.24 (latest; peer-supports ng22).\n- Remove unused dependencies that only added weight and vulnerabilities:\n  @ui5/webcomponents-ngx, @briebug/jest-schematic, lodash, jmespath,\n  @openmfp/eslint-config-typescript (no imports/lint config in the app).\n- Remove the jest test tooling (@angular-builders/jest, jest,\n  jest-preset-angular, jest-environment-jsdom) and its config\n  (jest.config.js, tsconfig.spec.json, angular.json test target). The app\n  has zero test files; the jest builder''s only effect was forcing the\n  deprecated webpack @angular-devkit/build-angular peer into the tree,\n  which was the sole source of the frontend''s remaining advisories. Build\n  and serve run on @angular/build (esbuild), unaffected. Root test:ui /\n  test:cov:ui are now no-ops accordingly.\n\nBackend:\n- @openmfp/portal-server-lib 0.163.24 -> 0.164.15 (latest).\n\nVulnerabilities — all three projects now report 0 (npm audit):\n- root: concurrently 9.2.1 -> ^9.2.4 (patches critical shell-quote).\n- backend: 37 -> 0 via the portal-server-lib bump + npm audit fix.\n- frontend: 78 -> 0 via the Angular 22 upgrade, removal of unused deps, and\n  dropping the webpack-based jest builder.\n\nVerified: `npm run build` (ui + server) and `npm test` succeed; `npm audit`\n= 0 in root, backend and frontend.\n\nSigned-off-by: renovate[bot] <29139614+renovate[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Fix web compoennts configuration\n\nSigned-off-by: renovate[bot] <29139614+renovate[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Fix web compoennts configuration\n\nSigned-off-by: renovate[bot] <29139614+renovate[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: renovate[bot] <29139614+renovate[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: renovate[bot] <29139614+renovate[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"77a3d746b598b40100cfd90f703e66790f72b439","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmfp/portal/git/trees/77a3d746b598b40100cfd90f703e66790f72b439"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmfp/portal/git/commits/ed9e8bf5dcd18d8662a5ac5a38c55d63a7f42141","verification":{"payload":"tree 77a3d746b598b40100cfd90f703e66790f72b439\nparent 19fbfb419d14f24378e39e2f6e254e4574dd1150\nauthor Grzegorz Krajniak <gkrajniak@gmail.com> 1786958276 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1786958276 +0200\n\nfeat: angular 22 migration (#752)\n\n* feat: migrate frontend to Angular 22, fix vulnerabilities, bump openmfp libs\n\nMigrate the portal frontend to Angular 22 and upgrade both OpenMFP libraries\nto their latest releases, then clear all npm audit findings across the three\nprojects (root, backend, frontend).\n\nFrontend — Angular 20 -> 22:\n- Bump all @angular/* packages and the build toolchain (@angular/build,\n  @angular/cli, @angular/compiler-cli) to ^22, and TypeScript to ~6.0\n  (required by Angular 22''s build pipeline).\n- Update tsconfig to modern resolution (module \"preserve\",\n  moduleResolution \"bundler\") to satisfy TS 6.0 (node10 resolution is\n  removed in TS 7 and now errors).\n- @openmfp/portal-ui-lib 0.186.15 -> 0.194.24 (latest; peer-supports ng22).\n- Remove unused dependencies that only added weight and vulnerabilities:\n  @ui5/webcomponents-ngx, @briebug/jest-schematic, lodash, jmespath,\n  @openmfp/eslint-config-typescript (no imports/lint config in the app).\n- Remove the jest test tooling (@angular-builders/jest, jest,\n  jest-preset-angular, jest-environment-jsdom) and its config\n  (jest.config.js, tsconfig.spec.json, angular.json test target). The app\n  has zero test files; the jest builder''s only effect was forcing the\n  deprecated webpack @angular-devkit/build-angular peer into the tree,\n  which was the sole source of the frontend''s remaining advisories. Build\n  and serve run on @angular/build (esbuild), unaffected. Root test:ui /\n  test:cov:ui are now no-ops accordingly.\n\nBackend:\n- @openmfp/portal-server-lib 0.163.24 -> 0.164.15 (latest).\n\nVulnerabilities — all three projects now report 0 (npm audit):\n- root: concurrently 9.2.1 -> ^9.2.4 (patches critical shell-quote).\n- backend: 37 -> 0 via the portal-server-lib bump + npm audit fix.\n- frontend: 78 -> 0 via the Angular 22 upgrade, removal of unused deps, and\n  dropping the webpack-based jest builder.\n\nVerified: `npm run build` (ui + server) and `npm test` succeed; `npm audit`\n= 0 in root, backend and frontend.\n\nSigned-off-by: renovate[bot] <29139614+renovate[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Fix web compoennts configuration\n\nSigned-off-by: renovate[bot] <29139614+renovate[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Fix web compoennts configuration\n\nSigned-off-by: renovate[bot] <29139614+renovate[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: renovate[bot] <29139614+renovate[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: renovate[bot] <29139614+renovate[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqgtHECRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA1usQAAIwceWjndQ3B/4sokaNOblG\nhsRPsXEzY0EFMPdRF3S5fzo3JS9Ed71/C5kqIQy4jlNW20XjKiujPLEZP0YZz/2u\nNC6WCLBmFwYrhllIT0A1Fz6vbpKuIiEUTHvFD/JLxCt5obU/PLySOxWjZXAdlEkS\nS3jhwsKlN/KzuAtS8S4pRCTiW+q4p/Vp+QAGOOFdaxsG7lwDsgfLTmaBErGEmeAY\nmB7a8V8wpr1NEw7QnJ4R5PFWQq8Eh14Y1hPuxpcLDgLV/sv35nwy7cyEENZKYW3G\nrUUWaKt+21VcgGJC0GpljBNt0RWBnM9CDmMH2WU+3sCHcrvPXo0BX8yayXjmQiJZ\nAuqM8d99MVNwWYVy83/diALkTsO37SZya3hdtbuU1nY4L/sLAGcDdJQSP5/KH1BA\n63CJalPFahXfxG/M6TpnZ3Pa18dMJiPsDvgLXTyNuZbP2NcIGun3W8xj5FhzCTSW\nwhzGlrFsr4w7H8u+NP2QrZi8WSC2zJ+R8lX4AYWzdYERNruL9aMXD/1clCF