ng","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzNDYzOTMy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/souravdev-eng/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/souravdev-eng/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/souravdev-eng/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/souravdev-eng/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/souravdev-eng/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/souravdev-eng","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/souravdev-eng/cloud-native-ecom-micro-service/commit/39634c9b6f72a0a1856ecbc7b3b7629c62842143","node_id":"C_kwDOLZGGINoAKDM5NjM0YzliNmY3MmEwYTE4NTZlY2JjN2IzYjc2MjljNjI4NDIxNDM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/souravdev-eng/cloud-native-ecom-micro-service/commit/f95306c0e858b9847facf56d6cb6241f761c147e","sha":"f95306c0e858b9847facf56d6cb6241f761c147e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/souravdev-eng/cloud-native-ecom-micro-service/commits/f95306c0e858b9847facf56d6cb6241f761c147e"}],"sha":"39634c9b6f72a0a1856ecbc7b3b7629c62842143","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/souravdev-eng/cloud-native-ecom-micro-service/commits/39634c9b6f72a0a1856ecbc7b3b7629c62842143"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/63463932?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/souravdev-eng/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/souravdev-eng/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/souravdev-eng/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/souravdev-eng/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/souravdev-eng","id":63463932,"login":"souravdev-eng","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzNDYzOTMy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/souravdev-eng/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/souravdev-eng/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/souravdev-eng/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/souravdev-eng/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/souravdev-eng/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/souravdev-eng","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/souravdev-eng/cloud-native-ecom-micro-service/commits/f95306c0e858b9847facf56d6cb6241f761c147e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-26T14:49:50Z","email":"souravmajumdar.developer@gmail.com","name":"saurav"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-26T14:49:50Z","email":"souravmajumdar.developer@gmail.com","name":"saurav"},"message":"feat(observability): auth requests traced to Tempo, linked with logs (ticket 03)\n\nCommon (2.2.0):\n- Add startTelemetry on the @ecom-micro/common/telemetry subpath, kept\n  free of Express so it can be imported before anything it instruments.\n  NodeSDK with http/express, mongodb/mongoose, pg, ioredis/redis and\n  amqplib instrumentation, parent-based ratio sampler\n  (OTEL_TRACES_SAMPLER_ARG) and OTLP/HTTP export. Exports nothing under\n  NODE_ENV=test or without an endpoint; metrics/logs OTLP defaults off.\n- Explicit serviceName/version/environment win over OTEL_SERVICE_NAME and\n  OTEL_RESOURCE_ATTRIBUTES; k8s pod/namespace from the downward API; no\n  process detector (command lines can carry secrets).\n- RedactingSpanExporter applies the log redaction policy to span\n  attributes, events, links and status. maskText now also masks secret\n  query parameters (?token=) and %40-encoded emails, in logs too.\n- Logger adds trace_id/span_id from the active span; traceIdHeader\n  middleware sets x-trace-id.\n- Tests: in-memory exporter over real HTTP (log/span/header share one\n  trace ID, traceparent continued, redaction) and a fake collector (no\n  export under test/no endpoint, OTLP export, collector down). Jest runs\n  with --experimental-vm-modules; isolateEnv gains an ''all'' scope.\n\nAuth: import ./tracing first, mount traceIdHeader, depend on ^2.2.0.\n\nPlatform: Tempo single-binary (72h, PV); Alloy OTLP receiver (4317/4318)\nforwarding to Tempo, trace_id as Loki structured metadata, alloy-srv\nService; Grafana Tempo datasource with Loki derived field and\ntraces-to-logs; OTEL_EXPORTER_OTLP_ENDPOINT in ecom-config; auth\ndeployment gets OTEL_SERVICE_NAME and pod/namespace env.","tree":{"sha":"abe7017d833e4a3c8c96271f604d83c89d8fb30c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/souravdev-eng/cloud-native-ecom-micro-service/git/trees/abe7017d833e4a3c8c96271f604d83c89d8fb30c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/souravdev-eng/cloud-native-ecom-micro-service/git/commits/f95306c0e858b9847facf56d6cb6241f761c147e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/63463932?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/souravdev-eng/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/souravdev-eng/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/souravdev-eng/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/souravdev-eng/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/souravdev-eng","id":63463932,"login":"souravdev-eng","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzNDYzOTMy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/souravdev-eng/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/souravdev-eng/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/souravdev-eng/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/souravdev-eng/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/souravdev-eng/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/souravdev-eng","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/souravdev-eng/cloud-native-ecom-micro-service/commit/f95306c0e858b9847facf56d6cb6241f761c147e","node_id":"C_kwDOLZGGINoAKGY5NTMwNmMwZTg1OGI5ODQ3ZmFjZjU2ZDZjYjYyNDFmNzYxYzE0N2U","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/souravdev-eng/cloud-native-ecom-micro-service/commit/51f2262fa9c34798baf2515d479e08727d419070","sha":"51f2262fa9c34798baf2515d479e08727d419070","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/souravdev-eng/cloud-native-ecom-micro-service/commits/51f2262fa9c34798baf2515d479e08727d419070"}],"sha":"f95306c0e858b9847facf56d6cb6241f761c147e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/souravdev-eng/cloud-native-ecom-micro-service/commits/f95306c0e858b9847facf56d6cb6241f761c147e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/63463932?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/souravdev-eng/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/souravdev-eng/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/souravdev-eng/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/souravdev-eng/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/souravdev-eng","id":63463932,"login":"souravdev-eng","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzNDYzOTMy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/souravdev-eng/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/souravdev-eng/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/souravdev-eng/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/souravdev-eng/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/souravdev-eng/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/souravdev-eng","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/souravdev-eng/cloud-native-ecom-micro-service/commits/51f2262fa9c34798baf2515d479e08727d419070/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-26T11:40:14Z","email":"souravmajumdar.developer@gmail.com","name":"saurav"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-26T11:40:14Z","email":"souravmajumdar.developer@gmail.com","name":"saurav"},"message":"feat(observability): structured JSON logs shipped to Loki via Alloy (ticket 02)\n\nCommon (2.1.1):\n- Add createLogger: one JSON line per entry on stdout with the fixed\n  schema (timestamp, level, service, version, environment, message,\n  error), LOG_LEVEL, pretty output in development, LOG_FORMAT override.\n- Add redaction: secret field names, emails (linear-time, any alphabet)\n  and Stripe keys are masked; toJSON, Errors, Maps/Sets, cycles, throwing\n  getters, depth and object-count limits handled.\n- winstonLogger is now a deprecated wrapper over createLogger and no\n  longer ships logs to Elasticsearch (ADR 0001).\n- Tests for schema, levels, formats, redaction and the wrapper;\n  prepublishOnly rebuilds before publishing.\n\nAuth: use createLogger, log login success/failure, depend on ^2.1.0.\n\nPlatform: k8s/observability (Alloy DaemonSet, Loki single-binary on a\nPV, Grafana with Loki provisioned and login required), a new\n`observability` skaffold profile, LOG_* config keys and Grafana admin\nsecret keys.","tree":{"sha":"32d0d46c8ddaa83344b92fc1f940f43b8931672d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/souravdev-eng/cloud-native-ecom-micro-service/git/trees/32d0d46c8ddaa83344b92fc1f940f43b8931672d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/souravdev-eng/cloud-native-ecom-micro-service/git/commits/51f2262fa9c34798baf2515d479e08727d419070","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/63463932?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/souravdev-eng/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/souravdev-eng/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/souravdev-eng/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/souravdev-eng/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/souravdev-eng","id":63463932,"login":"souravdev-eng","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzNDYzOTMy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/souravdev-eng/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github