2026-04-28T17:55:38Z","email":"souravmajumdar.developer@gmail.com","name":"saurav"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-28T17:55:38Z","email":"souravmajumdar.developer@gmail.com","name":"saurav"},"message":"feat(mfe-client): redesign dashboard UI with modern product listing, filters, and header\n\n- Header: announcement bar (dismissible) + sticky navbar with logo, search,\n  account dropdown, wishlist & cart icons; active NavLink highlighting\n- Footer: dark 4-column layout with social icons, payment badges, shop/support links\n- HomePage: hero banner with overlay text + CTA, category icon strip, tabbed\n  \"Trending Collections\" section replacing the old 4-column SmallProductCardList\n- ProductsPage: multi-select category checkboxes with instant URL sync\n  (?category=phone,earphone&rating=4), active filter chips with per-chip removal,\n  Amazon-style collapsible filter sidebar (no Apply button for instant filters),\n  redesigned pagination bar with page numbers and result count\n- ProductDetails: two-column layout, quantity stepper, breadcrumb nav, tags as chips\n- ProductCard / ProductList: fluid grid cards, star rating, \"View All\" section header\n- SmallProductCard / BrandList: modernised mini-card and greyscale brand strip\n- product service: productApiFeature now converts comma-separated query values to\n  MongoDB $in arrays, enabling multi-value filtering (e.g. ?category=phone,earphone)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1565240802372393a4bedec5549ffbe5076ff06e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/souravdev-eng/cloud-native-ecom-micro-service/git/trees/1565240802372393a4bedec5549ffbe5076ff06e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/souravdev-eng/cloud-native-ecom-micro-service/git/commits/b00e5fa6e5fbc5b4dff5a84383a3d6c56211d1a1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/634639