m/users/souravdev-eng/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/souravdev-eng/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/souravdev-eng/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/souravdev-eng/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/souravdev-eng/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/souravdev-eng","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/souravdev-eng/cloud-native-ecom-micro-service/commits/669852e153a7a0d3ca28d848ccf968451ff13614/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-25T11:37:54Z","email":"souravmajumdar.developer@gmail.com","name":"saurav"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-25T11:37:54Z","email":"souravmajumdar.developer@gmail.com","name":"saurav"},"message":"feat(product): index tags and description in product text search\n\nReplace the title-only `TextSearch_title` index with `ProductTextIndex`\ncovering `title`, `tags`, and `description` with relative weights\n10 / 5 / 1 and an explicit `default_language: ''english''`. Searches via\n`$text: { $search: ... }` will now match curated keywords and body\ncopy, not just product titles.\n\nMongoDB allows exactly one text index per collection and Mongoose''s\nensureIndex / autoIndex will not reshape an existing text index in\nplace — it logs an error and leaves the old one. So the model change\nalone is a no-op against any DB that already has the old index.\n\nAdd an idempotent one-shot migration at\n`product/src/migrations/2026-04-25-product-text-index.ts` (npm script\n`migrate:text-index`) that drops `TextSearch_title` if present and\nruns `Product.syncIndexes()` to create the new index, with a final\nverification that the new index exists. Safe to re-run.\n\nThe migration uses `syncIndexes()`, which is destructive for any index\non the collection that is NOT declared in the Mongoose schema; called\nout in a code comment so a future contributor adding an out-of-band\nindex does not lose it on the next migration run. All currently\ndeclared indexes (text + category/price/quantity compound) are covered.\n\nTracker entry in product/docs/tracking/product-service-review.md\nupdated with the migration command.","tree":{"sha":"c66eda369b6d6eb768c0669e7a9efa48865683a8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/souravdev-eng/cloud-native-ecom-micro-service/git/trees/c66eda369b6d6eb768c0669e7a9efa48865683a8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/souravdev-eng/cloud-native-ecom-micro-service/git/commits/669852e153a7a0d3ca28d848ccf968451ff13614","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/63463932?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/souravdev-eng/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/souravdev-eng/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/souravdev-eng/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/souravdev-eng/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/souravdev-eng","id":63463932,"login":"souravdev-eng","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzNDYzOTMy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/souravdev-eng/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/souravdev-eng/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/souravdev-eng/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/souravdev-eng/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/souravdev-eng/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/souravdev-eng","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/souravdev-eng/cloud-native-ecom-micro-service/commit/669852e153a7a0d3ca28d848ccf968451ff13614","node_id":"C_kwDOLZGGINoAKDY2OTg1MmUxNTNhN2EwZDNjYTI4ZDg0OGNjZjk2ODQ1MWZmMTM2MTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/souravdev-eng/cloud-native-ecom-micro-service/commit/56bf185cfa1860c55ab217275ec8dbd0ff9be0c1","sha":"56bf185cfa1860c55ab217275ec8dbd0ff9be0c1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/souravdev-eng/cloud-native-ecom-micro-service/commits/56bf185cfa1860c55ab217275ec8dbd0ff9be0c1"}],"sha":"669852e153a7a0d3ca28d848ccf968451ff13614","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/souravdev-eng/cloud-native-ecom-micro-service/commits/669852e153a7a0d3ca28d848ccf968451ff13614"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/63463932?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/souravdev-eng/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/souravdev-eng/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/souravdev-eng/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/souravdev-eng/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/souravdev-eng","id":63463932,"login":"souravdev-eng","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzNDYzOTMy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/souravdev-eng/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/souravdev-eng/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/souravdev-eng/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/souravdev-eng/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/souravdev-eng/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/souravdev-eng","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/souravdev-eng/cloud-native-ecom-micro-service/commits/56bf185cfa1860c55ab217275ec8dbd0ff9be0c1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-25T10:22:04Z","email":"souravmajumdar.developer@gmail.com","name":"saurav"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-25T10:22:04Z","email":"souravmajumdar.developer@gmail.com","name":"saurav"},"message":"fix(product): atomic quantity decrement in ProductQuantityUpdateListener\n\nReplace the read-modify-write sequence (findById -> check -> save) with\na single atomic findOneAndUpdate whose filter encodes the stock\nprecondition: { _id, quantity: { $gte: data.quantity } }. MongoDB\nguarantees atomicity for single-document updates, so the TOCTOU window\nthat previously allowed two concurrent consumers to both pass the\n`quantity >= requested` check and drive stock below zero is closed.\n\nA null result means either the product was deleted or stock is\ninsufficient; log each case distinctly for observability and ack-drop.\nRetrying the decrement would not help because the order has already\nbeen committed upstream — a future saga step should publish a\ncompensation event from here.\n\nChose the filter-guard form over a version-field OCC because the event\npayload does not carry an expected version; adding one would be pure\noverhead for a single-field conditional decrement. Noted in\nproduct/docs/tracking/product-service-review.md with the rationale and\nflagged that idempotency on RabbitMQ redelivery remains a separate,\nstill-open concern (review item G).","tree":{"sha":"4844c20d5b2a45a75db4711624f264e455126129","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/souravdev-eng/cloud-native-ecom-micro-service/git/trees/4844c20d5b2a45a75db4711624f264e455126129"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/souravdev-eng/cloud-native-ecom-micro-service/git/commits/56bf185cfa1860c55ab217275ec8dbd0ff9be0c1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/63463932?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/souravdev-eng/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/souravdev-eng/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/souravdev-eng/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/souravdev-eng/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/souravdev-eng","id":63463932,"login":"souravdev-eng","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzNDYzOTMy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/souravdev-e