api.github.com/users/souravdev-eng/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/souravdev-eng","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/souravdev-eng/cloud-native-ecom-micro-service/commits/f492ec50b4df1c5b08d6999cd59e6128dd8421e1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-25T08:02:40Z","email":"souravmajumdar.developer@gmail.com","name":"saurav"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-25T08:02:40Z","email":"souravmajumdar.developer@gmail.com","name":"saurav"},"message":"docs(learning-roadmap): add Mermaid visual path\n\nReplace the previous misaligned ASCII \"Visual Learning Path\" (removed in\nthe planner rewrite) with a Mermaid flowchart that renders correctly in\nGitHub, VS Code, and most markdown viewers. Solid arrows = recommended\norder; dashed arrows = soft prerequisites. Colour-coded by status\n(done / in progress / planned) to match the table.","tree":{"sha":"24ade93e0c3390fb71f2ab4a3eef4d4b8525e2dd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/souravdev-eng/cloud-native-ecom-micro-service/git/trees/24ade93e0c3390fb71f2ab4a3eef4d4b8525e2dd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/souravdev-eng/cloud-native-ecom-micro-service/git/commits/f492ec50b4df1c5b08d6999cd59e6128dd8421e1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/63463932?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/souravdev-eng/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/souravdev-eng/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/souravdev-eng/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/souravdev-eng/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/souravdev-eng","id":63463932,"login":"souravdev-eng","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzNDYzOTMy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/souravdev-eng/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/use