User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/souravdev-eng","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/souravdev-eng/cloud-native-ecom-micro-service/commits/70d1872d2ce983776c74d93c0932a62bc16ff59d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-25T07:58:03Z","email":"souravmajumdar.developer@gmail.com","name":"saurav"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-25T07:58:03Z","email":"souravmajumdar.developer@gmail.com","name":"saurav"},"message":"docs(learning-roadmap): rewrite as a planner, fix factual drift\n\nSlim the roadmap from a tutorial-catalogue (~1080 lines) into a planner\nwith a single status table as source of truth.\n\nReconcile and correct:\n- Conflicting statuses across summary table, per-topic sections, and\n  footer.\n- Mark sandboxes that do not yet exist on disk as Planned, instead of\n  presenting fictional directory trees as if real.\n- ELK -> EK; the platform runs Elasticsearch + Kibana, no Logstash.\n- Cart-in-Redis claim removed; cart service uses Postgres via TypeORM.\n- gRPC \"10x faster\" replaced with workload-dependent framing.\n- Distributed-lock framing aligned with sandbox/redis-learning/docs/04\n  (SET NX PX + Redlock trade-offs, not \"Redlock\").\n- Saga state need not live in Redis; treated as one option, not a prereq.\n- Security topic should logically precede API gateway, called out\n  explicitly.\n- Flag the hard-pinned `requiredVersion: ''19.1.1''` on react/react-dom\n  across the MFE configs as a topic for the Module Federation deep dive.\n- Drop keycap-emoji headings in favour of plain numbering.\n- Footer date refreshed.","tree":{"sha":"281c3da71fc60d24749fd748a5f872df05976282","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/souravdev-eng/cloud-native-ecom-micro-service/git/trees/281c3da71fc60d24749fd748a5f872df05976282"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/souravdev-eng/cloud-native-ecom-micro-service/git/commits/70d1872d2ce983776c74d93c0932a62bc16ff59d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","