it","node_id":"U_kgDOCwPsog","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yash990-bit/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yash990-bit/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yash990-bit/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yash990-bit/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yash990-bit/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yash990-bit","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jupyterlab/jupyter-builder/commits/2cf1db5797ad0a8c5388acc10b58563f2868411c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-27T11:20:50Z","email":"yash.raghubanshi2024@nst.rishihood.edu.in","name":"Yash Raghubanshi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-27T11:20:50Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Fix TypeError when package.json omits dependencies field (#182) (#183)\n\n* Fix TypeError when package.json omits dependencies field (#182)\n\nWhen an extension does not declare runtime dependencies in package.json, data.dependencies is undefined, causing Object.keys() to throw a TypeError during build. Guard with nullish coalescing to safely treat an omitted dependencies field as an empty object.\n\nFixes #182\n\n* Bump test matrix job timeout to 30m for Windows CI","tree":{"sha":"3a6d52b0821edf22e96c1e46f48e35ed635a84fb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jupyterlab/jupyter-builder/git/trees/3a6d52b0821edf22e96c1e46f48e35ed635a84fb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jupyterlab/jupyter-builder/git/commits/2cf1db5797ad0a8c5388acc10b58563f2868411c","verification":{"payload":"tree 3a6d52b0821edf22e96c1e46f48e35ed635a84fb\nparent 4ecea3c85917f5ed6313717d05b237089d81cfd2\nauthor Yash Raghubanshi <yash.raghubanshi2024@nst.rishihood.edu.in> 1790508050 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790508050 +0545\n\nFix TypeError when package.json omits dependencies field (#182) (#183)\n\n* Fix TypeErro