eter order but PluginClient expects\n(rows, cols). Passing them straight through caused the remote terminal\nto receive swapped dimensions (e.g. 236 rows × 36 cols instead of\n36 rows × 236 cols), corrupting terminal output.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpx1jNCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAmwQQABRtFmcYTFP9r9v2d4w3F9dU\nBfomLnP+n0Pf2CwO+7YL1aYQ16sNhanzPlIQqlN0t27P+wtfLHdZCtiPuXT2FXKy\n2KktQwugHs8g6uFU8knkZQ7kOZALVV1EeSX61QRdZsMMNCL80V9+Z/b5VmfPpGug\naEkSCR6nDQH5ajhOmi84t5V0EXWoh96yIY/6eswPdNB/V/hQnnr1a2EaMvbfGb66\n4xaQQsxpww4CbOSwB9Xtx1Cvxl+Hu4+lCJ45RhDnvdcaMRrrkDwz3D5CiHj/zNtx\n4GUCrJXPCN2QG030JoL91j44nqAYzuWFPYjpvJ95f+Fl0AKXenQ02a6LcJGzK/zz\n+GcFpNZwjhxrOkItiURuWbZ4e695a4l9jzbB3eIoZBrYxAfSMc4mNw7upuTwZbjD\nC9ZzYJ67Kfw+jxFgoHTisL2o3Dj6KZkyZNpP2NExseytf5n5XNyJ7UQVTN8S/p4q\nVkDjatRUZRtSvR/mrVBn9+iVvorHcDfJfPU32zC0dFb1g0PWJqpzq6ivIVgmVmpx\nMjYT0XWyNRSiz/aCoW5WO6SM2vop9/MtBhtwj6QIUiVhPKWY5no9vchyOKt+OVib\nxIK8gn9M0p7gkQVBvh0C3i7O+pASgMHQ55Syzrm7Rnkr2e7BUXjy1zvdiTHWZE3x\nkYrLWVSbgPO5fCr+Jrfu\n=P925\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-03-28T04:27:58Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"Use