 attach (#51)\n\nAttachSession returns a buffer containing any output that arrived before\nthe UI attached (e.g. the shell prompt). The return value was being\nignored, so the initial prompt never appeared — users had to type a\ncommand before seeing any output.","tree":{"sha":"bc7ff9ca918982075f9c7349cfe1d29a2f5a6387","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/omniviewdev/omniview/git/trees/bc7ff9ca918982075f9c7349cfe1d29a2f5a6387"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/omniviewdev/omniview/git/commits/349eebaaa8aeaa757e756b9b37cc8f2fb03567fc","verification":{"payload":"tree bc7ff9ca918982075f9c7349cfe1d29a2f5a6387\nparent 89cf05521940f47d79fcb050990203c5d3b5196e\nauthor Joshua Pare <65102852+joshuapare@users.noreply.github.com> 1774669310 -0600\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1774669310 -0500\n\nfix: render buffered output on terminal session attach (#51)\n\nAttachSession returns a buffer containing any output that arrived before\nthe UI attached (e.g. the shell prompt). The return value was being\nignored, so the initial prompt never appeared — users had to type a\ncommand before seeing any output.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpx03+CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAESsQAIZdRk2pZprRvuehdbKfM0D8\nqCJRpOs2S+WKstLuwwPJV6DBe/IF+wNrfnIX4sdXBeYhDiYbPs/NEQQTM9yhPyYW\nut5iY6uXqAT5SrksxpU4BYkUl/grQPwPdDMU2Oe6waOP5ESKO6LV7vlRt56JFOJT\n3JwQ+HmtoPmzjA7QzlV+G8S38gELUc5/bCm5ME//7YkYWcbTNkzwV0uxt83pwnz3\nrkuqgDQ2WNt9GnJTBTYKh9qn3J1TNwkVczNFCeKlbiW+p1TZZpp6bmhYfVAd4KjF\nifDiVgDx5kxKPtw/BMrzpyRXsIW5LZqy77lmdDeDsaSAN3onXpnz3yQXK6B8EwXE\n3yeshOg6AL3b+m4AobKESpDfh0gRfk48MAywgd9xKBNT+1pmJWJtJeHlXMy6HyGZ\nVsPhPemKWE6iWcMJ5r9sxcEYm3/o5POVaw1zW80DSKw1VHOuvOKkn6uaQCuqR93d\nTweGxJGRnhnjhoi/0ti+3leyrd4EYE2hvoNcwNL58jgcvb+LYNT679bv6KZf4cOp\nr2DQsSEdRzyPECU+LosUANVNVy2N5BEVobgm0WFKXzcEeXOy9zHMeD75Wo2HyTTY\n2uqM5Jebi07tOMsHSb++/pwcWk0omAhGW182OQ7rN9YEwvfJRnMgvrtfTohiMDGl\nfI4klwGorE7bhE2nd5Jb\n=SA0b\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-03-28T03:41:51Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/omniviewdev/omniview/commit/349eebaaa8aeaa757e756b9b37cc8f2fb03567fc","node_id":"C_kwDOLcPQu9oAKDM0OWVlYmFhYThhZWFhNzU3ZTc1NmI5YjM3Y2M4ZjJmYjAzNTY3ZmM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/omniviewdev/omniview/commit/89cf05521940f47d79fcb050990203c5d3b5196e","sha":"89cf05521940f47d79fcb050990203c5d3b5196e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/omniviewdev/omniview/commits/89cf05521940f47d79fcb050990203c5d3b5196e"}],"sha":"349eebaaa8aeaa757e756b9b37cc8f2fb03567fc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/omniviewdev/omniview/commits/349eebaaa8aeaa757e756b9b37cc8f2fb03567fc"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65102852?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joshuapare/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joshuapare/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joshuapare/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joshuapare/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/joshuapare","id":65102852,"login":"joshuapare","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1MTAyODUy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joshuapare/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joshuapare/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joshuapare/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joshuapare/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joshuapare/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/joshuapare","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/omniviewdev/omniview/commits/89cf05521940f47d79fcb050990203c5d3b5196e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-28T02:05:54Z","email":"65102852+joshuapare@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Joshua Pare"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-28T02:05:54Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: keep log viewer pinned during drawer resize and minimize/reexpand (#48)\n\n* fix: keep log viewer pinned to bottom during drawer resize and restore position after minimize/reexpand\n\nAdd a ResizeObserver on the log scroll container that re-pins to the\nlast entry when follow mode is active during any container size change\n(drag resize, minimize/expand, fullscreen toggle). When follow mode is\noff and the drawer is restored from minimized, the first visible line\nindex is saved and restored so the user''s scroll position is preserved.\n\n* fix: use double rAF in restore-from-minimized branch to match follow-mode guard timing\n\n* fix: use callback ref so ResizeObserver attaches when scroll container mounts late\n\nThe scroll container only renders once log entries arrive. Using a\ncallback ref + state ensures the ResizeObserver effect re-runs when\nthe element actually appears in the DOM, rather than bailing out on\ninitial mount when parentRef.current is still null.\n\n* fix: anchor saved scroll position by timestamp instead of index\n\nStore the first visible entry''s timestamp (stable across buffer\neviction) rather than its array index. On restore, resolve the\ntimestamp back to the current index via findEntryIndexByTime so\nthe scroll position survives head eviction while minimized.","tree":{"sha":"6005f5a4bd9ed8cb7951256720a5b29ab9a23aad","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/omniviewdev/omniview/git/trees/6005f5a4bd9ed8cb7951256720a5b29ab9a23aad"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/omniviewdev/omniview/git/commits/89cf05521940f47d79fcb050990203c5d3b5196e","verification":{"payload":"tree 6005f5a4bd9ed8cb7951256720a5b29ab9a23aad\nparent e92d797980451f5a50343e5a0b5acfb3330f44c2\nauthor Joshua Pare <65102852+joshuapare@users.noreply.github.com> 1774663554 -0600\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1774663554 -0500\n\nfix: keep log viewer pinned during drawer resize and minimize/reexpand (#48)\n\n* fix: keep log viewer pinned to bottom during drawer resize and restore position after minimize/reexpand\n\nAdd a ResizeObserver on the log scroll container that re-pins to the\nlast entry when follow mode is active during any container size change\n(drag resize, minimize/expand, fullscreen toggle). When follow mode is\noff and the drawer is restored from minimized, the first visible line\nindex is saved and restored so the user''s scroll position is preserved.\n\n* fix: use double rAF in restore-from-minimized branch to match follow-mode guard timing\n\n* fix: use callback ref so ResizeObserver attaches when scroll container mounts late\n\nThe scroll container only renders once log entries arrive. Using a\ncallback ref + state ensures the ResizeObserver effect re-runs when\nthe element actually appears in the DOM, rather than bailing out on\ninitial mount when parentRef.current is still null.\n\n* fix: anchor saved scroll position by timestamp instead of index\n\nStore the first visible entry''s timestamp (stable across buffer\neviction) rather than its array index. On restore, resolve the\ntimestamp back to the current index via findEntryIndexByTime so\nthe scroll position survives head eviction while minimized.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpxzeCCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAyYwQAB2yHssPuESrGlKczzQJX/Ni\n2Nb7BZ+reBQRyksYtmYFdLTpZD52SvT8Jc9wd4ktqDNhdKi13/lHcZTwmYf7SElT\nVlLzg+jsK1+ox3shL2Bj7bWB7WqSX1K4vBhtIPdM3ONcmmUFvNozdamMmlE4SPml\n3bgo8K/v1tm+iKyWh1M3fSlT5MFEqchihVF7uFDehl4HHs+ta3lW7HX4ekwitKxh\ncUgv8YkUaKEWH6a3lee5ogyadk7Sq0Vq5W0fDDpEEtibdWbpLL34BuiiFs0ngVRP\nqdk89YFqXPEZATX+tbR78uVCb8GOnc49PIS19vg0LUXovFgcSiWEvVxTxbfH6nxO\ne0n9dORWG9IFbb7iZ2nmaTxWTfnUMSDrtb3GVIL+aDa9RCI4wLc/YcFx5jU+VyEa\np1RUEUk42/sK6xhdPFSnX9dGQY3Uu8Yn615OB1mwqhs9fJpF0khdGwunji8g1mvR\n0FhBZXCb3Lyaj8hbNbhE6wJRMYvjDRwLgluXKgOme3ByZO3/AGD2G6RkEIz400zA\nLkuucQw3DiJULhUpaIylLIBzvea3K6IU+GOoojA/FiidL/Nt/N+VA74+QlG8Oi1J\nqUHUDTPxvHvG+d8suOSvo9eXYSYBmKzR1Zu/Gov9cZSRxqZBs5q0XLdIo/oWJmkv\nP5yOBUaUYE/ZlGPDvAg6\n=KPiZ\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-03-28T02:05:54Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/omniviewdev/omniview/commit