502d0891a57be8f5ecc902e3b400fd28"}],"sha":"dd6cd05332e721e1efce631e878f0c545909e00b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/omniviewdev/omniview/commits/dd6cd05332e721e1efce631e878f0c545909e00b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65102852?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joshuapare/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joshuapare/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joshuapare/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joshuapare/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/joshuapare","id":65102852,"login":"joshuapare","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1MTAyODUy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joshuapare/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joshuapare/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joshuapare/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joshuapare/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joshuapare/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/joshuapare","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/omniviewdev/omniview/commits/3ccb6414502d0891a57be8f5ecc902e3b400fd28/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-22T15:00:57Z","email":"65102852+joshuapare@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Joshua Pare"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-22T15:00:57Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: validate usePluginData return type against default value (#46)\n\n* fix: validate usePluginData return type against default value shape\n\nThe Go backend returns `any` from the data store, and the TypeScript\ngeneric cast (`result as T`) provides no runtime safety. When stored\ndata has a different JSON type than expected (e.g. object instead of\narray), callers crash with confusing errors like\n\"favorites.includes is not a function\".\n\nAdd a `matchesShape` check that validates the structural type (array,\nobject, primitive) matches the default value before accepting the\nstored result. Falls back to the default with a console warning on\nmismatch.\n\n* fix: handle null defaultValue in matchesShape\n\ntypeof null === ''object'' caused null defaults to match any object or\narray. Check for null explicitly before the object/array branches.","tree":{"sha":"2ffdbc609ea8f504518ff2effe89eb57aadf7eb1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/omniviewdev/omniview/git/trees/2ffdbc609ea8f504518ff2effe89eb57aadf7eb1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/omniviewdev/omniview/git/commits/3ccb6414502d0891a57be8f5ecc902e3b400fd28","verification":{"payload":"tree 2ffdbc609ea8f504518ff2effe89eb57aadf7eb1\nparent dd2bd5560d1e49f49baa04760796cbdec0e0e9a2\nauthor Joshua Pare <65102852+joshuapare@users.noreply.github.com> 1774191657 -0600\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1774191657 -0500\n\nfix: validate usePluginData return type against default value (#46)\n\n* fix: validate usePluginData return type against default value shape\n\nThe Go backend returns `any` from the data store, and the TypeScript\ngeneric cast (`result as T`) provides no runtime safety. When stored\ndata has a different JSON type than expected (e.g. object instead of\narray), callers crash with confusing errors like\n\"favorites.includes is not a function\".\n\nAdd a `matchesShape` check that validates the structural type (array,\nobject, primitive) matches the default value before accepting the\nstored result. Falls back to the default with a console warning on\nmismatch.\n\n* fix: handle null defaultValue in matchesShape\n\ntypeof null === ''object'' caused null defaults to match any object or\narray. Check for null explicitly before the object/array branches.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpwAQpCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAukQQABMfvI1Zf69O5AcRJt386tD6\nRJLWPFJNs6GhgRIc147w/bloodMzJUDOaCt7+rBC/GlL2lvi5l9yjYPI7aFBR7u/\nzhZfnfSvxMJe6DVBkLH0bQjFLBhJde+bNGqy2VhPV9O6fK3zzdRL20GlbE2lLy/K\nh2Kx274J0eiRNPV3AveiwthGoJSH9CdJfyGt9zCoMRrjr7VhdkevpeR4IiLsmDIj\n+4ItB+U7wkOnrD76ebB84e7TmGyl/Rvm4TRM7w8r/fLKUlrA3BW/PoaUhufOj/jP\nmJVLHoC+Eq17d5P/5bZjY0JXjWNTv7YWpKs1e1pj8VycwZEZDY0VtjBG+zG7ZegX\n1RfR9j6ksDjoRm5+AHRhIheRm0OTe1G51ILT0eySPKJXqGcWiNV+ros4c+h9np12\nX9Ikd3Hkp4ba4bpV8Bd2S8jxdmLFoTrjCV25n7rEDz9mtQpFjgRiM6bNFg/XkH+B\nXmRpPr3bMC78q7Frp5yKBlsQamanIGdp5ZcWiGKeZykYjvy6upBfyZbRZ/Cb6EOU\nIAivuQJMi+kx6qqA6yJcDRBg4Ph8Ag3fU374FT/EGFACyTCuYDRoyZg+IZNV+hQ8\nV4qJwIbmaaTZNHeEl7MnNZwlQ4tQmCqyXIdp/sqCEUlEdnmerR0m7MOHKE3zXuwf\nYyKPIYAHNCB6pKaWbpJQ\n=qrFf\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-03-22T15:00:58Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/omniviewdev/omniview/commit/3ccb6414502d0891a57be8f5ecc902e3b400fd28","node_id":"C_kwDOLcPQu9oAKDNjY2I2NDE0NTAyZDA4OTFhNTdiZThmNWVjYzkwMmUzYjQwMGZkMjg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/omniviewdev/omniview/commit/dd2bd5560d1e49f49baa04760796cbdec0e0e9a2","sha":"dd2bd5560d1e49f49baa04760796cbdec0e0e9a2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/omniviewdev/omniview/commits/dd2bd5560d1e49f49baa04760796cbdec0e0e9a2"}],"sha":"3ccb6414502d0891a57be8f5ecc902e3b400fd28","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/omniviewdev/omniview/commits/3ccb6414502d0891a57be8f5ecc902e3b400fd28"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65102852?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joshuapare/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joshuapare/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joshuapare/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joshuapare/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/joshuapare","id":65102852,"login":"joshuapare","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1MTAyODUy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joshuapare/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joshuapare/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joshuapare/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joshuapare/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joshuapare/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/joshuapare","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/omniviewdev/omniview/commits/dd2bd5560d1e49f49baa04760796cbdec0e0e9a2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-22T00:53:25Z","email":"65102852+joshuapare@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Joshua Pare"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-22T00:53:25Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Unified state directory + bbolt settings store (#45)\n\n* feat: unified state directory with appstate package\n\nAdd internal/appstate package centralizing all filesystem state access\nbehind os.OpenRoot for kernel-enforced path containment. State directory\nis configurable via OMNIVIEW_STATE_DIR env var, build-time ldflags, or\ndefaults to ~/.omniview.\n\n- ScopedRoot wraps os.Root with defense-in-depth path validation\n- Flock-based instance locking prevents concurrent state corruption\n- All 15+ subsystems migrated from scattered os.UserHomeDir() calls\n- Remove dead code: pkg/settings/, backend/storage/local.go\n- Plugin ID validation prevents path traversal\n- Cached PluginData/PluginStore roots with proper error propagation\n- Idempotent Service.Close via sync.Once\n\n* refactor: move service wrappers from main.go to their respective packages\n\n* fix: update CI workflows to Wails v3, restore dist/.gitkeep","tree":{"sha":"4f35a084f8f139a15e569c8a608becfb2f64fbcf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/omniviewdev/omniview/git/trees/4f35a084f8f139a15e569c8a608becfb2f64fbcf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/omniviewdev/omniview/git/commits/dd2bd5560d1e49f49baa04760796cbdec0e0e9a2","verification":{"payload":"tree 4f35a084f8f139a15e569c8a608becfb2f64fbcf\nparent a0ec1de805cdf885fe893e869011466cfef2c510\nauthor Joshua Pare <65102852+joshuapare@users.noreply.github.com> 1774140805 -0600\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1774140805 -0500\n\nUnified state directory + bbolt settings store (#45)\n\n* feat: unified state directory with appstate package\n\nAdd internal/appstate package centralizing all filesystem state access\nbehind os.OpenRoot for kernel-enforced path containment. State directory\nis configurable via OMNIVIEW_STATE_DIR env var, build-time ldflags, or\ndefaults to ~/.omniview.\n\n- ScopedRoot wraps os.Root with defense-in-depth path validation\n- Flock-based instance locking prevents concurrent state corruption\n- All 15+ subsystems migrated from scattered os.UserHomeDir() calls\n- Remove dead code: pkg/settings/, backend/storage/local.go\n- Plugin ID validation prevents path traversal\n- Cached PluginData/PluginStore roots with proper error propagation\n- Idempotent Service.Close via sync.Once\n\n* refactor: move service wrappers from main.go to their respective packages\n\n* fix: update CI workflows to Wails v3, restore dist/.gitkeep","reason":"va