so they are hidden\nby default. Mark telemetry endpoint/auth settings as devOnly.\nUpdate Wails TS binding with devOnly field.\n\n* chore: bump plugin-sdk to v0.4.1 and regenerate bindings\n\nUpdates go.mod to use plugin-sdk v0.4.1 which includes the\nDevOnly field on Setting. Regenerates Wails bindings via\nmake bindings.","tree":{"sha":"e69c80d4831eddd38c5725182a9b28db8702120e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/omniviewdev/omniview/git/trees/e69c80d4831eddd38c5725182a9b28db8702120e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/omniviewdev/omniview/git/commits/f201ed8ed57630bf524d1525ac1e67db61b144b3","verification":{"payload":"tree e69c80d4831eddd38c5725182a9b28db8702120e\nparent e9db9b7612b8894343352e24f5229e200f8e52c0\nauthor Joshua Pare <65102852+joshuapare@users.noreply.github.com> 1773846405 -0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1773846405 -0500\n\nfeat: dev-mode only settings visibility (#42)\n\n* feat: hide dev-only settings unless dev mode is active\n\nAdd useDevMode hook that checks if any plugin is in dev mode.\nFilter devOnly settings in SettingsEntries so they are hidden\nby default. Mark telemetry endpoint/auth settings as devOnly.\nUpdate Wails TS binding with devOnly field.\n\n* chore: bump plugin-sdk to v0.4.1 and regenerate bindings\n\nUpdates go.mod to use plugin-sdk v0.4.1 which includes the\nDevOnly field on Setting. Regenerates Wails bindings via\nmake bindings.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpur+FCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA220QABzFnRRZrM3K+2AL3yT/GDBQ\nRd+D8Xs8gsrSucm6IJf9NBxo6CE3aOEB4HqKweC7sF6WcI8VBvvU+cgrQWzOj4ev\ndvHwgTigLO406v00z9ZnOJ1QpPHTWnok7SK6bhK+w2NeV1Hw5z5iovgeYqCZSYu0\nlWZJNpdksUhtN06WIiv7QqFXaHRyPPC2ze0WauxDsKyrzrQsBYavs2UDn+vuUoHh\n31RLyV0Z2Kab6RCjh8iEkTJ5Zk95HzNzbgvASnWmdu/J+SPSbBQRfscvto/ieZ5D\nogwBcDSQKupT3juPKK1SQ21//T2dW/+McO+Tb/gJyVSul6PQEw41xz3ZZAxzWyxM\nor6yMPsXV6sbcRLw378yjDZwtiPpwjIiSMjQ4CfcL6rcRbipRmenIGAwcaAYzcSN\noqJF0490XeXskvKbXmMWVHLZfvcaASaJpLvEVtHOr5ifgCy78ER9XPpZJg/ecpWK\