dev/omniview/commits/af00025aecffd03a1cccffe885137b6e16d100c0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-18T01:27:35Z","email":"65102852+joshuapare@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Joshua Pare"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-18T01:27:35Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Fix log level parsing matching ''error'' in non-error contexts (#34)\n\n* fix: restrict log level detection to structured positions\n\nLog level parsing previously matched keywords like ERROR/WARN anywhere\nin the log message body, causing false positives (e.g. \"connection error\ncount\" being flagged as error-level). Now only matches levels in:\n- JSON fields (level/severity/lvl)\n- Key=value pairs (level=ERROR)\n- Bracketed markers ([ERROR])\n- Near line start (after optional timestamp)\n\n* fix: handle spaced and quoted key/value in log level detection\n\nKV_LEVEL_RE now matches formats like level = \"error\" and\nseverity : ''warn'' in addition to level=ERROR.\n\n* fix: correct word boundary placement in KV_LEVEL_RE regex\n\nMove \\b before the optional closing quote so it anchors on the\ncaptured word characters, not on the quote.","tree":{"sha":"1cb076079d771c8a94020f59bb79872e81be779a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/omniviewdev/omniview/git/trees/1cb076079d771c8a94020f59bb79872e81be779a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/omniviewdev/omniview/git/commits/af00025aecffd03a1cccffe885137b6e16d100c0","verification":{"payload":"tree 1cb076079d771c8a94020f59bb79872e81be779a\nparent 9ce3bbf8b9bf328158ad8cec1b57e1cb332d8bea\nauthor Joshua Pare <65102852+joshuapare@users.noreply.github.com> 1773797255 -0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1773797255 -0500\n\nFix log level parsing matching ''error'' in non-error contexts (#34)\n\n* fix: restrict log level detection to structured positions\n\nLog level parsing previously matched keywords like ERROR/WARN anywhere\nin the log message body, causing false positives (e.g. \"connection error\ncount\" being flagged as error-level). Now only matches levels in:\n- JSON fields (level/severity/lvl)\n- Key=value pairs (level=ERROR)\n- Bracketed markers ([ERROR])\n- Near line start (after optional timestamp)\n\n* fix: handle spaced and quoted key/value in log level detection\n\nKV_LEVEL_RE now matches formats like level = \"error\" and\nseverity : ''warn'' in addition to level=ERROR.\n\n* fix: correct word boundary placement in KV_LEVEL_RE regex\n\nMove \\b before the optional closing quote so it anchors on the\ncaptured word characters, not on the quote.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpuf+HCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAGUEQAAWs4gkSualbI1H6/FwO9v3S\n1WBMUVMfa1FBWxjiLuCsdCY9mbO+HlIJGklx5/YMf1slY3UuE7q1ixb9eJqjkz4G\nkjQDwaSaK+ZxZKaGwwGodH7J+LiiQ1VWwtwg7sB54+ZhBqNksOnWrUQXZpDRL0pM\nF+8f8YbPkdsj5yFnsdUsT6TEKAs2zBA0tBx2WNPG49be4CZqMRAH9nfRk1jsdbwU\ne9gMPNJH7orfQzveOzIz5+PGq0H5WGzbU1LL3TqbzcCMf2Tvr0+S5IDa3l9rCvXD\nFXwcYdiWPS8CZkVWoVWpHO6b2KuLRXSuqAGGBoe1XmoL64fr2X7J2RBBlfHL7wkH\nqCOMhiJwdqPJYufkJP1pBeNeOSWXsqYn3PQz/+sgxPllX/P7SfuwsuqlPGfCFe0x\nq3yirimemVhT6PbK72gssRomHwGHdqIe6UIg5XU4G++TsA/+AFMffLQRQ+ZburIu\nnhLeO92ln6DGE3P14bCiGK4K8r4LaZIOOd5QyX9OKCAKhk4hQpwXqexbOy53Sjg2\n5ghvWqdVZFRk48qVpI6U/feJrHebpDxwJlKQ5axzLQ+Lxh4T9PP95tNdW2A/h2HK\nK+VR01s4BKAMWjafjzzs7BJeC4F/Go5+QN4LtRiJb/MjRVMC3z6Np1amtROZ9vOM\nT81brxvEw5r80y3Dw+8g\n=Mop7\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-03-18T01:27:37Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/user