/repos/omniviewdev/omniview/commits/fc1c4056fc4b716da95a5580e6a8837fd3557c5a"}],"sha":"805758bce03a939c765aa1f1e3d1442574073f7d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/omniviewdev/omniview/commits/805758bce03a939c765aa1f1e3d1442574073f7d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65102852?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joshuapare/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joshuapare/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joshuapare/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joshuapare/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/joshuapare","id":65102852,"login":"joshuapare","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1MTAyODUy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joshuapare/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joshuapare/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joshuapare/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joshuapare/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joshuapare/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/joshuapare","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/omniviewdev/omniview/commits/fc1c4056fc4b716da95a5580e6a8837fd3557c5a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-11T04:16:23Z","email":"65102852+joshuapare@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Joshua Pare"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-11T04:16:23Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: replace PluginManager with class-based PluginService (#24)\n\n* feat: replace PluginManager with class-based PluginService\n\nRedesigns the plugin UI system from the ground up, replacing the\nfragmented PluginManager/PluginRegistryProvider with a single\nPluginService class that owns all plugin lifecycle state.\n\nKey changes:\n- PluginService: class-based service with useSyncExternalStore for\n  reactive state. Manages load/unload/reload/retry/forceReset with\n  validated phase transitions and generation-based stale detection.\n- Extension point unification: sidebars, drawers, and custom\n  contributions all normalize into NormalizedContribution[] and flow\n  through the extension point registry.\n- Dependency injection: PluginServiceDeps interface decouples the\n  service from SystemJS, Wails events, and the extension registry,\n  enabling comprehensive testing with real implementations.\n- Error isolation: ExtensionPointRenderer wraps each contribution in\n  its own ErrorBoundary with structured crash logging.\n  PluginSurfaceBoundary provides surface-level error isolation for\n  routes, drawers, and modals.\n- Test infrastructure: createTestDeps() with InMemoryModuleImporter,\n  InMemoryEventBus, Deferred<T> for async control. 500+ tests covering\n  lifecycle, validation, normalization, transitions, events, cleanup,\n  observability, React hooks, extension points, route building, and\n  consumer migration verification.\n- Consumer migration: RouteProvider, RightDrawerProvider,\n  AppStatusFooter, homepage, and sidebar consumers migrated to new\n  hooks (usePluginService, usePluginRoutes, useExtensionPoint).\n\nRemoves: PluginManager, PluginRegistryProvider, PluginRegistryContext,\nusePluginRegistry, loader.ts, builtins.ts, constants.ts, devSharedReady.\n\n* fix: address PR review feedback\n\n- Wire store-level mutations to registry subscribers (prevent missed\n  notifications), clean up per-store subscriptions on removal\n- Non-mutating sort in _sortDeterministic (spread before sort)\n- Add pluginId to ExtensionPointStoreContract, remove unsafe casts\n- Use ExtensionPointRegistryContract in provider.tsx instead of\n  concrete class\n- Use RESOURCE_SIDEBAR_EXTENSION_POINT_ID constant in store.ts\n- Remove unnecessary await on synchronous SystemJS.delete\n- Fix hardcoded absolute path in consumerMigration.test.ts\n- Better loadedAt sentinel in PluginRenderer (phase-aware)\n- Include surface identity in PluginSurfaceBoundary resetKeys\n- Remove dead unreachable function-type branch in validation.ts\n- Use PluginWindow.registerExtensionPoints() in validation tests\n- Remove redundant invalidateSnapshot before notify calls\n- Add debug logging in contribution replay catch\n- Filter malformed entries in extractExtensionPoints\n- Error handling for loadAll in PluginServiceProvider (.finally)\n- Split useMemo in usePluginService for stable method identity\n- Replace setTimeout(50) sleeps with vi.waitFor in event tests\n- Fix test 20.7 with Deferred to exercise stale-result path\n- Remove redundant tests 24.12/24.13, renumber 24.10→24.9\n- Remove redundant importer registration in observability test\n- Fix non-null assertion pattern in reload test\n- Use regex for migration source checks in react.test.tsx\n- Add code block language identifiers in README.md\n- Add debug log for swallowed DevServerManager error\n- Add eslint-disable for stable-ref useEffect deps\n- Consistent [PluginService] log prefix in devSharedExporter\n\n* fix: address PR review round 2\n\n- Fix stale store reference in useExtensionPoint subscribe by resolving\n  store outside useCallback and including it in deps array\n- Replace invalid ''error.50'' palette token with ''error.light'' in\n  PluginSurfaceBoundary fallback components\n- Validate non-array extensions field in validatePluginExports (fail\n  fast instead of silently dropping)\n- Return null in PluginRenderer when plugin is not yet ready instead\n  of rendering with undefined keys\n- Clarify README: ErrorBoundary covers render-time errors only, route\n  mount prefix is /_plugin/{pluginId}\n- Skip coverage/dist directories in cleanup test walk\n- Use pw.registerExtensionPoints() instead of _extensions mutation in\n  events.test.ts and PluginService.test.ts helpers\n- Use query status instead of data length for refetchInterval in\n  useInstalledPlugins (stops polling after first success, retries on\n  error)\n\n* fix: address PR review round 3 feedback\n\n- Move ExtensionProvider invariant from useEffect to synchronous render\n- Add pluginID to PluginRenderer resetKeys and composite key\n- Extract BoundaryKind union type for PluginSurfaceBoundary\n- Use !== undefined checks in logPluginBoundaryError\n- Add backendPhase assertion in reload persistence test\n- Add debug snapshot assertions after stale resolve in reset test\n- Add plugin/recovered event test coverage\n- Remove unused moduleHash from InstalledPluginDescriptor\n- Clarify README: routes API, extension point definition docs","tree":{"sha":"8ac71a3651043ea96d5b20525b7712a7c3a9d90e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/omniviewdev/omniview/git/trees/8ac71a3651043ea96d5b20525b7712a7c3a9d90e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/omniviewdev/omniview/git/commits/fc1c4056fc4b716da95a5580e6a8837fd3557c5a","verification":{"payload":"tree 8ac71a3651043ea96d5b20525b7712a7c3a9d90e\nparent c16bc274d694a641de0669e62a8b37932af9d27a\nauthor Joshua Pare <65102852+joshuapare@users.noreply.github.com> 1773202583 -0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1773202583 -0500\n\nfeat: replace PluginManager with class-based PluginService (#24)\n\n* feat: replace PluginManager with class-based PluginService\n\nRedesigns the plugin UI system from the ground up, replacing the\nfragmented PluginManager/PluginRegistryProvider with a single\nPluginService class that owns all plugin lifecycle state.\n\nKey changes:\n- PluginService: class-based service with useSyncExternalStore for\n  reactive state. Manages load/unload/reload/retry/forceReset with\n  validated phase transitions and generation-based stale detection.\n- Extension point unification: sidebars, drawers, and custom\n  contributions all normalize into NormalizedContribution[] and flow\n  through the extension point registry.\n- Dependency injection: PluginServiceDeps interface decouples the\n  service from SystemJS, Wails events, and the extension registry,\n  enabling comprehensive 