re/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joshuapare/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joshuapare/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/joshuapare","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/omniviewdev/omniview/commits/c46c17c73b17862e3f6086430ae5cfc6f970c87d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-01T17:51:04Z","email":"joshuabpare@gmail.com","name":"Joshua Pare"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-06T06:17:41Z","email":"joshuabpare@gmail.com","name":"Joshua Pare"},"message":"feat: add unified versioning and adapter infrastructure for all plugin capabilities\n\nImplement the engine v1 plugin package structure with version-negotiated\nadapter pattern across all 6 capabilities (resource, exec, logs, metric,\nnetworker, settings).\n\nResource capability: full rewrite with canonical ResourceProvider interface,\nAdapterV1, ref-counted subscriptions, event gating via engineWatchSink,\nconnection persistence, and EventEmitter abstraction. 250 tests across\n19 test files covering CRUD, watch, subscriptions, concurrency, lifecycle,\ntype metadata, actions, relationships, health, and integration (EI-001..019).\n\nNon-resource capabilities: versioning infrastructure added (canonical\nprovider interface + AdapterV1 pass-through + dispenseProvider with\nversion switch). Zero behavioral changes — existing logic carried forward.\n\nShared infrastructure: PluginBackend.NegotiatedVersion(), VersionedPlugins\nin loader, CurrentProtocolVersion constant, PluginRecord.ProtocolVersion field.","tree":{"sha":"9d04434e44767722bee28e7b1774600e18867c6a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/omniviewdev/omniview/git/trees/9d04434e44767722bee28e7b1774600e18867c6a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/omniviewdev/omniview/git/commits/c46c17c73b17862e3f6086430ae5cfc6f970c87d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":