low: upload-artifact v3 -> v4 and Node 18 -> 20\n\nThe E2E Tests workflow hard-failed at setup because actions/upload-artifact@v3\nis now deprecated and auto-rejected by GitHub. Bump it to v4. Also raise\nnode-version 18 -> 20 (and setup-node@v3 -> v4) so `yarn start`/openmrs tooling,\nwhich requires node >= 20.11, can run the dev server for the Playwright tests.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"af899c787c9e931c7f907d16ba06c502e57fceaf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IntelliSOFT-Consulting/eHospital3.x-Apps/git/trees/af899c787c9e931c7f907d16ba06c502e57fceaf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IntelliSOFT-Consulting/eHospital3.x-Apps/git/commits/d04d27cba610c38351bc13d53834d59bdbf06679","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1963527?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moshonk/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moshonk/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moshonk/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moshonk/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/moshonk","id":1963527,"login":"moshonk","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NjM1Mjc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moshonk/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moshonk/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moshonk/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moshonk/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moshonk/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/moshonk","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/IntelliSOFT-Consulting/eHospital3.x-Apps/commit/d04d27cba610c38351bc13d53834d59bdbf06679","node_id":"C_kwDOLdbNt9oAKGQwNGQyN2NiYTYxMGMzODM1MWJjMTNkNTM4MzRkNTliZGJmMDY2Nzk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/IntelliSOFT-Consulting/eHospital3.x-Apps/commit/83ae1ae6f148ced8b02624a3cb9842c63757479f","sha":"83ae1ae6f148ced8b02624a3cb9842c63757479f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IntelliSOFT-Consulting/eHospital3.x-Apps/commits/83ae1ae6f148ced8b02624a3cb9842c63757479f"}],"sha":"d04d27cba610c38351bc13d53834d59bdbf06679","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IntelliSOFT-Consulting/eHospital3.x-Apps/commits/d04d27cba610c38351bc13d53834d59bdbf06679"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1963527?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moshonk/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moshonk/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moshonk/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moshonk/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/moshonk","id":1963527,"login":"moshonk","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NjM1Mjc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moshonk/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moshonk/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moshonk/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moshonk/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moshonk/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/moshonk","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IntelliSOFT-Consulting/eHospital3.x-Apps/commits/83ae1ae6f148ced8b02624a3cb9842c63757479f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-24T10:15:15Z","email":"omondi.ken@gmail.com","name":"moshonk"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-24T10:15:15Z","email":"omondi.ken@gmail.com","name":"moshonk"},"message":"Fix build: bump turborepo-gh-artifacts v1 -> v3 (deprecated artifact API)\n\nThe build job''s `felixmosh/turborepo-gh-artifacts@v1` post step uploads the\nturbo cache via the deprecated v1/v2 artifact API (\"Create Artifact Container\"),\nwhich GitHub now rejects: `Error: Create Artifact Container failed: The artifact\nname ... is not valid`. v3 uses the supported artifact backend. The release job\nalready pins v3; this aligns the build job with the same (input-compatible) version.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e0387661d1592f7c6553ccc69ba30a5fcf93cc93","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IntelliSOFT-Consulting/eHospital3.x-Apps/git/trees/e0387661d1592f7c6553ccc69ba30a5fcf93cc93"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IntelliSOFT-Consulting/eHospital3.x-Apps/git/commits/83ae1ae6f148ced8b02624a3cb9842c63757479f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1963527?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moshonk/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moshonk/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moshonk/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moshonk/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/moshonk","id":1963527,"login":"moshonk","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NjM1Mjc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moshonk/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moshonk/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moshonk/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moshonk/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moshonk/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/moshonk","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/IntelliSOFT-Consulting/eHospital3.x-Apps/commit/83ae1ae6f148ced8b02624a3cb9842c63757479f","node_id":"C_kwDOLdbNt9oAKDgzYWUxYWU2ZjE0OGNlZDhiMDI2MjRhM2NiOTg0MmM2Mzc1NzQ3OWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/IntelliSOFT-Consulting/eHospital3.x-Apps/commit/87a732eed3fb78b0db80f91f2300ed6e3e8e2bd9","sha":"87a732eed3fb78b0db80f91f2300ed6e3e8e2bd9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IntelliSOFT-Consulting/eHospital3.x-Apps/commits/87a732eed3fb78b0db80f91f2300ed6e3e8e2bd9"}],"sha":"83ae1ae6f148ced8b02624a3cb9842c63757479f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IntelliSOFT-Consulting/eHospital3.x-Apps/commits/83ae1ae6f148ced8b02624a3cb9842c63757479f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1963527?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moshonk/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moshonk/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moshonk/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moshonk/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/moshonk","id":1963527,"login":"moshonk","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NjM1Mjc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moshonk/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moshonk/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moshonk/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moshonk/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moshonk/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/moshonk","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IntelliSOFT-Consulting/eHospital3.x-Apps/commits/87a732eed3fb78b0db80f91f2300ed6e3e8e2bd9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-24T10:07:41Z","email":"omondi.ken@gmail.com","name":"moshonk"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-24T10:07:41Z","email":"omondi.ken@gmail.com","name":"moshonk"},"message":"Fix build: use Node 20 in CI (openmrs requires node >= 20.11)\n\nopenmrs@next (10.0.1-pre) declares `engines.node >= 20.11.0` and its build\ntooling uses `import.meta.dirname`, which is undefined on Node 18. That made\n`openmrs build` crash with `TypeError [ERR_INVALID_ARG_TYPE]: The \"paths[0]\"\nargument must be of type string. Received undefined` (importmap.js:88) for any\npackage that was a turbo cache miss.\n\nBump node-version 18 -> 20 across the build, pre_release, and release jobs, and\nupgrade the pre_release job''s actions/setup-node@v1 -> v4 to match.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a4f82df05c04738bb81dda0756396da2f09e7a5c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IntelliSOFT-Consulting/eHospital3.x-Apps/git/trees/a4f82df05c04738bb81dda0756396da2f09e7a5c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IntelliSOFT-Consulting/eHospital3.x-Apps/git/commits/87a732eed3fb78b0db80f91f2300ed6e3e8e2bd9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1963527?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moshonk/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moshonk/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moshonk/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moshonk/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/moshonk","id":1963527,"login":"moshonk","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NjM1Mjc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moshonk/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moshonk/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moshonk/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moshonk/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moshonk/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/moshonk","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/IntelliSOFT-Consulting/eHospital3.x-Apps/commit/87a732eed3fb78b0db80f91f2300ed6e3e8e2bd9","node_id":"C_kwDOLdbNt9oAKDg3YTczMmVlZDNmYjc4YjBkYjgwZjkxZjIzMDBlZDZlM2U4ZTJiZDk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/IntelliSOFT-Consulting/eHospital3.x-Apps/commit/557cc6f7b2159cf18d110e33e2b0f75ba8ab315e","sha":"557cc6f7b2159cf18d110e33e2b0f75ba8ab315e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IntelliSOFT-Consulting/eHospital3.x-Apps/commits/557cc6f7b2159cf18d110e33e2b0f75ba8ab315e"}],"sha":"87a732eed3fb78b0db80f91f2300ed6e3e8e2bd9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IntelliSOFT-Consulting/eHospital3.x-Apps/commits/87a732eed3fb78b0db80f91f2300ed6e3e8e2bd9"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1963527?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moshonk/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moshonk/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moshonk/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moshonk/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/moshonk","id":1963527,"login":"moshonk","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NjM1Mjc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moshonk/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moshonk/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moshonk/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moshonk/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moshonk/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/moshonk","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IntelliSOFT-Consulting/eHospital3.x-Apps/commits/557cc6f7b2159cf18d110e33e2b0f75ba8ab315e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-24T10:02:22Z","email":"omondi.ken@gmail.com","name":"moshonk"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-24T10:02:22Z","email":"omondi.ken@gmail.com","name":"moshonk"},"message":"Fix build: remove stray esm-billing-app/.yarnrc.yml pinning missing yarn 4.1.1\n\nesm-billing-app was the only package carrying its own .yarnrc.yml, which set\n`yarnPath: .yarn/releases/yarn-4.1.1.cjs` — a binary that was never committed.\nWhen turbo ran the per-package build, yarn tried to exec the missing release\nand aborted with \"Internal Error: The yarn-path option has been set ... but the\nspecified location doesn''t exist\", failing the whole CI build.\n\nRemoving the override lets the package inherit the root yarn 3.6.1 config like\nevery other package in the workspace.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2dda43fb89a0fb66d94a31f063f4ab8e74c27543","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IntelliSOFT-Consulting/eHospital3.x-Apps/git/trees/2dda43fb89a0fb66d94a31f063f4ab8e74c27543"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IntelliSOFT-Consulting/eHospital3.x-Apps/git/commits/557cc6f7b2159cf18d110e33e2b0f75ba8ab315e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1963527?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moshonk/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moshonk/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moshonk/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moshonk/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/moshonk","id":1963527,"login":"moshonk","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NjM1Mjc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moshonk/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moshonk/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moshonk/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moshonk/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moshonk/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/moshonk","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/IntelliSOFT-Consulting/eHospital3.x-Apps/commit/557cc6f7b2159cf18d110e33e2b0f75ba8ab315e","node_id":"C_kwDOLdbNt9oAKDU1N2NjNmY3YjIxNTljZjE4ZDExMGUzM2UyYjBmNzViYThhYjMxNWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/IntelliSOFT-Consulting/eHospital3.x-Apps/commit/cf0b3011f155492ede2ca66446bce6b2e4da7aa2","sha":"cf0b3011f155492ede2ca66446b