n","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5MDM2MQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/simpulton/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/simpulton/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/simpulton/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/simpulton/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/simpulton/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/simpulton","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/onehungrymind/enterprisey-apps/commits/bbfd695e51763b46eeb2da466d15598d52714c1f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-04T05:52:32Z","email":"lukas@presolved.io","name":"Lukas Ruebbelke"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-04T05:54:50Z","email":"lukas@presolved.io","name":"Lukas Ruebbelke"},"message":"Upgrade Nx 18→22, Angular 17→21, NestJS 10→11, NgRx 17→21\n\n- Nx 18.0.8 → 22.4.5 (incremental: 18→19→20→21→22)\n- Angular 17.1 → 21.1.2 with Angular Material 21.1.2\n- NgRx 17.0 → 21.0.1\n- NestJS 10.x → 11.x (with Express v5 support)\n- TypeScript 5.3 → 5.9.3\n- Jest 29.x → 30.2.0\n- Zone.js 0.14.3 → 0.16.0\n- @types/node 18.x → 22.x\n\nKey changes:\n- Fix TypeORM deprecation: Connection → DataSource in 5 provider files\n- Module Federation imports updated for Nx 20+ (@nx/module-federation/angular)\n- Runtime MF APIs kept at @nx/angular/mf (browser-safe lightweight exports)\n- Pin @module-federation/node@2.7.21 to avoid rspack/enhanced version conflicts\n- Angular control flow migration: *ngFor/*ngIf → @for/@if (auto-migrated)\n- Angular standalone: explicit standalone:false for non-standalone components\n- Jest config converted to CJS syntax for Node.js type-stripping\n- TSConfig moduleResolution updated to ''bundler''\n- Bootstrap options migrated to providers pattern\n- provideServerRendering moved from @angular/platform-server to @angular/ssr\n- Cypress updated to v15 with injectDocumentDomain config\n- Jest matcher aliases updated for Jest 30 compatibility\n- jest-preset-angular setup migrated to setupZoneTestEnv","tree":{"sha":"f4b43b413c4280536e37e638d0e761d27eb0c0c4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/onehungrymind/enterprisey-apps/git/trees/f4b43b413c4280536e37e638d0e761d27eb0c0c4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/onehungrymind/enterprisey-apps/git/commits/bbfd695e51763b46eeb2da466d15598d52714c1f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/590361?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/simpulton/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/simpulton/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/simpulton/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/simpulton/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/simpulton","id":590361,"login":"simpulton","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5MDM2MQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/simpulton/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/simpulton/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/simpulton/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/simpulton/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/simpulton/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/simpulton","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/onehungrymind/enterprisey-apps/commit/bbfd695e51763b46eeb2da466d15598d52714c1f","node_id":"C_kwDOLeFzOtoAKGJiZmQ2OTVlNTE3NjNiNDZlZWIyZGE0NjZkMTU1OThkNTI3MTRjMWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/onehungrymind/enterprisey-apps/commit/5168eb0b89c1f7c939d0d68876049128c47c335e","sha":"5168eb0b89c1f7c939d0d68876049128c47c335e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/onehungrymind/enterprisey-apps/commits/5168eb0b89c1f7c939d0d68876049128c47c335e"}],"sha":"bbfd695e51763b46eeb2da466d15598d52714c1f","