pos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaseeey/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaseeey/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaseeey","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jaseeey/request-manager/commits/1799ce04a8b72b37679705cdafae698ff28545b2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T11:41:36Z","email":"me@jasey.io","name":"Jason Ilicic"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T11:41:36Z","email":"me@jasey.io","name":"Jason Ilicic"},"message":"Align code and docs with the documented style\n\n* Convert every JSDoc tag in request-manager to the documented\n  `{Type} name - Description` form, bracketing optional parameters.\n* Use US spelling in JSDoc and rename `normalisedMethod` to\n  `normalizedMethod`.\n* Apply the class blank-line rules: one after the opening brace and\n  none between the last field and the constructor.\n* Use Australian/British spelling in the README prose.","tree":{"sha":"6b125f8853a9d431fbbc5ddb243a7a7b7bf102c8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jaseeey/request-manager/git/trees/6b125f8853a9d431fbbc5ddb243a7a7b7bf102c8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jaseeey/request-manager/git/commits/1799ce04a8b72b37679705cdafae698ff28545b2","verification":{"payload":"tree 6b125f8853a9d431fbbc5ddb243a7a7b7bf102c8\nparent dc3b95c9a19623113bfdd239cfd5117b1dbcef7c\nauthor Jason Ilicic <me@jasey.io> 1790854896 +0930\ncommitter Jason Ilicic <me@jasey.io> 1790854896 +0930\n\nAlign code and docs with the documented style\n\n* Convert every JSDoc tag in request-manager to the documented\n  `{Type} name - Description` form, bracketing optional parameters.\n* Use US spelling in JSDoc and rename `normalisedMethod` to\n  `normalizedMethod`.\n* Apply the class blank-line rules: one after the opening brace and\n  none between the last field and the constructor.\n* Use Australian/British spelling in the README prose.\