s://api.github.com/users/nandubatchu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nandubatchu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nandubatchu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nandubatchu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nandubatchu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nandubatchu","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Apna-HQ/apna-app/commits/59b7b970c765cbe8a45e08f414168ee836edfe28/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-15T12:47:32Z","email":"nandubatchu@gmail.com","name":"Yadunandan Batchu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-15T12:47:32Z","email":"nandubatchu@gmail.com","name":"Yadunandan Batchu"},"message":"fix(feed): revert tight 5s relay timeout; surface kind-3 load failures\n\n- lib/nostr/core.ts: QUERY_MAX_WAIT_MS back to 10s. The earlier cut to\n  5s was the cause of the \"No posts yet\" regression — relays serving\n  large kind-3 contact lists were timing out before sending any event,\n  so GetFeed''s contacts lookup returned null and the whole feed\n  resolved to []. Five-relay pool means slower EOSE consensus too.\n- lib/nostr/api.ts:\n    - GetFeed FOLLOWING_FEED now throws a descriptive error when the\n      kind-3 lookup yields null instead of silently returning []. The\n      mini-app can distinguish \"couldn''t load contacts\" from \"you\n      follow nobody\" from \"no recent notes\".\n    - per-batch limit bumped from wantLimit (often 20) to max(wantLimit, 50)\n      so the merge step has a real pool to sort/dedupe across batches.\n\nfeat(landing): drop noisy watermark, redesign hero for desktop\n\n- app/page.tsx: replaced the faded icon-512 watermark with a subtle\n  ambient backdrop — dot-grid pattern + two brand-green radial blurs\n  + a soft fade-to-background at the bottom. No more visual noise\n  competing with copy.\n- Desktop layout: max-w-6xl shell, two-column hero at lg, balanced\n  ~1.1:1 split, larger type at lg. Feature list now real cards\n  (border + bg-card + hover state) with title + body text instead of\n  one-line stubs, in a 2-col grid on sm and 1-col on lg so they don''t\n  feel sparse next to the wider hero text.\n\nfeat(build): richer starter — feed cards now include author avatar + name\n\n- STARTER_HTML feed render: each note has a header row (28px avatar +\n  bold name + timestamp) and a body row. Skeleton placeholders show\n  immediately, then apna.social.userMetadata(pubkey) is called per\n  unique author in parallel and hydrated into the DOM as each resolves.","tree":{"sha":"5f43c696c9e24a8049c540d353907c6c6225b715","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Apna-HQ/apna-app/git/trees/5f43c696c9e24a8049c540d353907c6c6225b715"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Apna-HQ/apna-app/git/commits/59b7b970c765cbe8a45e08f414168ee836edfe28","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8403524?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nandubatchu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nandubatchu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nandubatchu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nandubatchu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/nandubatchu","id":8403524,"login":"nandubatchu","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg0MDM1MjQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nandubatchu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nandubatchu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nandubatchu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nandubatchu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nandubatchu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nandubatchu","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Apna-HQ/apna-app/commit/59b7b970c765cbe8a45e08f414168ee836edfe28","node_id":"C_kwDOLfdlMdoAKDU5YjdiOTcwYzc2NWNiZThhNDVlMDhmNDE0MTY4ZWU4MzZlZGZlMjg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Apna-HQ/apna-app/commit/448d741a8b070304dd9c4b29931f7c0205d7a024","sha":"448d741a8b070304dd9c4b29931f7c0205d7a024","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Apna-HQ/apna-app/commits/448d741a8b070304dd9c4b29931f7c0205d7a024"}],"sha":"59b7b970c765cbe8a45e08f414168ee836edfe28","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Apna-HQ/apna-app/commits/59b7b970c765cbe8a45e08f414168ee836edfe28"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8403524?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nandubatchu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nandubatchu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nandubatchu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nandubatchu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/nandubatchu","id":8403524,"login":"nandubatchu","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg0MDM1MjQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nandubatchu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nandubatchu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nandubatchu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nandubatchu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nandubatchu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nandubatchu","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Apna-HQ/apna-app/commits/448d741a8b070304dd9c4b29931f7c0205d7a024/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-15T12:33:29Z","email":"nandubatchu@gmail.com","name":"Yadunandan Batchu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-15T12:33:29Z","email":"nandubatchu@gmail.com","name":"Yadunandan Batchu"},"message":"feat(build): richer starter app with visible loaders + SDK feedback\n\nRewrites STARTER_HTML for /build/editor so first-time users immediately\nsee what the SDK is doing for them.\n\n- Hero + tagline: \"Each card below is one SDK call. No relay code, no\n  signing, no nostr-tools.\" So they know what''s being abstracted.\n- Three demo cards, each labeled with the actual SDK call:\n    apna.identity.me()         — profile (avatar, name, truncated npub)\n    apna.social.feed()         — last 5 notes from FOLLOWING_FEED\n    apna.social.publishNote()  — one-tap publish\n- Every async step shows a spinner during work, a success state on\n  resolution, and a clear red error state on failure. Permission-denied\n  and \"no active profile\" both render legibly instead of silently failing.\n- Mobile-first layout matching apna-app''s design tokens.","tree":{"sha":"a29e9450ccd087f7a41892fe105dcfa82d1669f2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Apna-HQ/apna-app/git/trees/a29e9450ccd087f7a41892fe105dcfa82d1669f2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Apna-HQ/apna-app/git/commits/448d741a8b070304dd9c4b29931f7c0205d7a024","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8403524?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nandubatchu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nandubatchu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nandubatchu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nandubatchu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/nandubatchu","id":8403524,"login":"nandubatchu","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg0MDM1MjQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nandubatchu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nandubatchu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nandubatchu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nandubatchu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nandubatchu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nandubatchu","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Apna-HQ/apna-app/commit/448d741a8b070304dd9c4b29931f7c0205d7a024","node_id":"C_kwDOLfdlMdoAKDQ0OGQ3NDFhOGIwNzAzMDRkZDljNGIyOTkzMWY3YzAyMDVkN2EwMjQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Apna-HQ/apna-app/commit/a47dd366d5c89721b577cfc4668c8771a5cc5be7","sha":"a47dd366d5c89721b577cfc4668c8771a5cc5be7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Apna-HQ/apna-app/commits/a47dd366d5c89721b577cfc4668c8771a5cc5be7"}],"sha":"448d741a8b070304dd9c4b29931f7c0205d7a024","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Apna-HQ/apna-app/commits/448d741a8b070304dd9c4b29931f7c0205d7a024"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8403524?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nandubatchu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nandubatchu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nandubatchu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nandubatchu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/nandubatchu","id":8403524,"login":"nandubatchu","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg0MDM1MjQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nandubatchu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nandubatchu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nandubatchu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nandubatchu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nandubatchu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nandubatchu","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Apna-HQ/apna-app/commits/a47dd366d5c89721b577cfc4668c8771a5cc5be7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-15T12:23:40Z","email":"nandubatchu@gmail.com","name":"Yadunandan Batchu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-15T12:23:40Z","email":"nandubatchu@gmail.com","name":"Yadunandan Batchu"},"message":"feat(build): VS Code editor for /build/editor; speed up feed fetch\n\n- /build/editor now uses Monaco (@monaco-editor/react) with an apna-dark\n  theme, line numbers, and HTML syntax highlighting. Loaded via\n  next/dynamic({ ssr: false }) so it only ships on this route.\n- /build landing copy + \"Monaco\" badge updated to reflect the new editor.\n- GetFeed: batch the followed-author list into chunks of 100 and fan out\n  in parallel — single mega-filters were being silently dropped by relays\n  for users following many profiles.\n- DEFAULT_RELAYS expanded from 2 → 5 for resilience.\n- pool.querySync wait reduced 10s → 5s so a stuck relay no longer blocks\n  the host bridge.","tree":{"sha":"41d852640aeb96376d9bf25d89d393e98a30a210","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Apna-HQ/apna-app/git/trees/41d852640aeb96376d9bf25d89d393e98a30a210"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Apna-HQ/apna-app/git/commits/a47dd366d5c89721b577cfc4668c8771a5cc5be7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8403524?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nandubatchu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nandubatchu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nandubatchu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nandubatchu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/nandubatchu","id":8403524,"login":"nandubatchu","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg0MDM1MjQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nandubatchu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nandubatchu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nandubatchu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nandubatchu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nandubatchu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nandubatchu","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Apna-HQ/apna-app/commit/a47dd366d5c89721b577cfc4668c8771a5cc5be7","node_id":"C_kwDOLfdlMdoAKGE0N2RkMzY2ZDVjODk3MjFiNTc3Y2ZjNDY2OGM4NzcxYTVjYzViZTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Apna-HQ/apna-app/commit/31f31a0ed76b0c2ad0ee7852030cdc4cac54956d","sha":"31f31a0ed76b0c2ad0ee7852030cdc4cac54956d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Apna-HQ/apna-app/commits/31f31a0ed76b0c2ad0ee7852030cdc4cac54956d"}],"sha":"a47dd366d5c89721b577cfc4668c8771a5cc5be7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Apna-HQ/apna-app/commits/a47dd366d5c89721b577cfc4668c8771a5cc5be7"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8403524?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nandubatchu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nandubatchu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nandubatchu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nandubatchu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/nandubatchu","id":8403524,"login":"nandubatchu","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg0MDM1MjQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nandubatchu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nandubatchu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nandubatchu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nandubatchu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nandubatchu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nandubatchu","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Apna-HQ/apna-app/commits/31f31a0ed76b0c2ad0ee7852030cdc4cac54956d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-15T10:12:53Z","email":"nandubatchu@gmail.com","name":"Yadunandan Batchu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-15T10:12:53Z","email":"nandubatchu@gmail.com","name":"Yadunandan Batchu"},"message":"fix: restore build editor html preview","tree":{"sha":"775c270f279673f8f50813d13536d0b4783699ea","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Apna-HQ/apna-app/git/trees/775c270f279673f8f50813d13536d0b4783699ea"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Apna-HQ/apna-app/git/commits/31f31a0ed76b0c2ad0ee7852030cdc4cac54956d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8403524?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nandubatchu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nandubatchu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nandubatchu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nandubatchu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/nandubatchu","id":8403524,"login":"nandubatchu","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg0MDM1MjQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nandubatchu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nandubatchu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nandubatchu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nandubatchu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nandubatchu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nandubatchu","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Apna-HQ/apna-app/commit/31f31a0ed76b0c2ad0ee7852030cdc4cac54956d","node_id":"C_kwDOLfdlMdoAKDMxZjMxYTBlZDc2YjBjMmFkMGVlNzg1MjAzMGNkYzRjYWM1NDk1NmQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Apna-HQ/apna-app/commit/169aea784afeac8adb185063a7436a4f38c46012","sha":"169aea784afeac8adb185063a7436a4f38c46012","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Apna-HQ/apna-app/commits/169aea784afeac8adb185063a7436a4f38c46012"}],"sha":"31f31a0ed76b0c2ad0ee7852030cdc4cac54956d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Apna-HQ/apna-app/commits/31f31a0ed76b0c2ad0ee7852030cdc4cac54956d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8403524?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nandubatchu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nandubatchu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nandubatchu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nandubatchu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/nandubatchu","id":8403524,"login":"nandubatchu","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg0MDM1MjQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nandubatchu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nandubatchu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nandubatchu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nandubatchu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nandubatchu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nandubatchu","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Apna-HQ/apna-app/commits/169aea784afeac8adb185063a7436a4f38c46012/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-15T09:46:22Z","email":"nandubatchu@gmail.com","name":"Yadunandan Batchu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-15T09:46:22Z","email":"nandubatchu@gmail.com","name":"Yadunandan Batchu"},"message":"build: bundle sharp''s linux-x64 binaries into the lockfile\n\nVercel build failed with:\n  Could not load the \"sharp\" module using the linux-x64 runtime\n  Failed to collect page data for /api/favicon\n\nRoot cause: sharp ships platform-specific binaries via optionalDependencies\n(@img/sharp-linux-x64, @img/sharp-libvips-linux-x64, …). The lockfile was\ngenerated on a linux-arm64 host (the dev box), so npm recorded only the\narm64 entries. Vercel runs on linux-x64, follows the lockfile, finds no\nlinux-x64 binary to install, and `require(''sharp'')` blows up at build.\n\nFix:\n- Inject @img/sharp-linux-x64, @img/sharp-libvips-linux-x64, the linuxmusl\n  variants, and their libvips into package-lock.json with the same shape as\n  the existing linux-arm64 entries (same versions; sharp 0.33.5 + libvips 1.0.4).\n- Add .npmrc with `supportedArchitectures` so future `npm install` runs keep\n  recording cross-arch binaries instead of silently dropping them again.\n\nNo other dependency versions change (`git diff --stat package-lock.json` →\n71 insertions, 0 deletions). Local linux-arm64 build still passes; the new\nentries unlock the Vercel linux-x64 install.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4b145bdeca8fa8b843c7513a6e8ee70ee12bc879","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Apna-HQ/apna-app/git/trees/4b145bdeca8fa8b843c7513a6e8ee70ee12bc879"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Apna-HQ/apna-app/git/commits/169aea784afeac8adb185063a7436a4f38c46012","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8403524?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nandubatchu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nandubatchu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nandubatchu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nandubatchu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/nandubatchu","id":8403524,"login":"nandubatchu","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg0MDM1MjQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nandubatchu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nandubatchu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nandubatchu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nandubatchu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nandubatchu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nandubatchu","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Apna-HQ/apna-app/commit/169aea784afeac8adb185063a7436a4f38c46012","node_id":"C_kwDOLfdlMdoAKDE2OWFlYTc4NGFmZWFjOGFkYjE4NTA2M2E3NDM2YTRmMzhjNDYwMTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Apna-HQ/apna-app/commit/739c3be228860fb71fe10aca07f10d41049f1802","sha":"739c3be228860fb71fe10aca07f10d41049f1802","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Apna-HQ/apna-app/commits/739c3be228860fb71fe10aca07f10d41049f1802"}],"sha":"169aea784afeac8adb185063a7436a4f38c46012","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Apna-HQ/apna-app/commits/169aea784afeac8adb185063a7436a4f38c46012"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8403524?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nandubatchu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nandubatchu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nandubatchu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nandubatchu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/nandubatchu","id":8403524,"login":"nandubatchu","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg0MDM1MjQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nandubatchu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nandubatchu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nandubatchu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nandubatchu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nandubatchu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nandubatchu","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Apna-HQ/apna-app/commits/739c3be228860fb71fe10aca07f10d41049f1802/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-15T09:24:11Z","email":"nandubatchu@gmail.com","name":"Yadunandan Batchu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-15T09:24:11Z","email":"nandubatchu@gmail.com","name":"Yadunandan Batchu"},"message":"build: pin Node 22.x (Vercel deprecated 18.x)\n\nVercel rejected the previous deploy with:\n  \"Node.js Version \\\"18.x\\\" is discontinued and must be upgraded.\"\n\nAdd engines.node + .nvmrc so the runtime requirement is documented in the\nrepo. The dashboard setting still needs a manual bump from 18.x → 22.x\non the Vercel side (the dashboard is Vercel''s source of truth).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6585e53cfad2b479a9295b5698a5b00a5b24f78f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Apna-HQ/apna-app/git/trees/6585e53cfad2b479a9295b5698a5b00a5b24f78f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Apna-HQ/apna-app/git/commits/739c3be228860fb71fe10aca07f10d41049f1802","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8403524?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nandubatchu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nandubatchu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nandubatchu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nandubatchu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/nandubatchu","id":8403524,"login":"nandubatchu","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg0MDM1MjQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nandubatchu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nandubatchu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nandubatchu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nandubatchu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nandubatchu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nandubatchu","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Apna-HQ/apna-app/commit/739c3be228860fb71fe10aca07f10d41049f1802","node_id":"C_kwDOLfdlMdoAKDczOWMzYmUyMjg4NjBmYjcxZmUxMGFjYTA3ZjEwZDQxMDQ5ZjE4MDI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Apna-HQ/apna-app/commit/0b0a30f4b089876f9b33a24c12ad6a1bfe6e17cf","sha":"0b0a30f4b089876f9b33a24c12ad6a1bfe6e17cf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Apna-HQ/apna-app/commits/0b0a30f4b089876f9b33a24c12ad6a1bfe6e17cf"}],"sha":"739c3be228860fb71fe10aca07f10d41049f1802","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Apna-HQ/apna-app/commits/739c3be228860fb71fe10aca07f10d41049f1802"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8403524?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nandubatchu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nandubatchu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nandubatchu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nandubatchu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/nandubatchu","id":8403524,"login":"nandubatchu","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg0MDM1MjQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nandubatchu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nandubatchu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nandubatchu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nandubatchu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nandubatchu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nandubatchu","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Apna-HQ/apna-app/commits/0b0a30f4b089876f9b33a24c12ad6a1bfe6e17cf/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-15T09:15:48Z","email":"nandubatchu@gmail.com","name":"Yadunandan Batchu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-15T09:15:48Z","email":"nandubatchu@gmail.com","name":"Yadunandan Batchu"},"message":"redesign: capability bridge + permission gate + builder + landing split\n\nImplements the host side of the SDK redesign against @apna/sdk@^0.3.2.\nThis is the big closeout commit — every Phase-3 through Phase-12 task in\nthe redesign sheet lands here (per-task notes in REDESIGN_TASKS.md in the\nworkspace tracker).\n\nSDK consumption\n- @apna/sdk: file:../sdk → ^0.3.2 (matches the freshly-published package\n  on npm). package-lock.json rebuilt from registry.\n\nCapability registry + per-instance host (HOST-003/-008/-009)\n- lib/apna-host/capabilities/{nostr.ts, identity/v1.ts, social/v1.ts, index.ts}\n  — flat CapabilityHandlers registry keyed by full capability string\n  (''nostr.signEvent'', ''social.v1.publishNote'', ''identity.v1.me'', …) with\n  per-capability gating (''open'' for reads, ''gated'' for writes / sensitive)\n- lib/apna-host/instance-manager.ts — per-iframe ApnaHost lifecycle; no\n  more window.apna / window.methodHandlers singletons\n- lib/nostr/method-handlers.ts deleted (replaced by the registry)\n- lib/nostr/core.ts simplified: removed the N-iframes-hammer-relays tier\n  queue; one host page now drives reads via SimplePool with a small\n  in-flight dedup cache\n- lib/nostr/api.ts + api-extensions.ts pruned of dead exports (HOST-021)\n- app/api/nostr/pool/get/route.ts deleted (HOST-021)\n\nIdentity sources (HOST-001/-002/-003/-004)\n- lib/utils.ts: signerType: ''local'' | ''nip07'' | ''nip46'' on IUserKeyPair\n  with migration of existing profiles; addExtensionProfileToLocalStorage\n- lib/nostr/nip07.ts (new) — thin window.nostr wrapper\n- ProfileManager gets a third \"Browser Extension\" tab + signerType badges\n\nPermission gate + prompt + settings UI (HOST-010/-011/-012/-014)\n- lib/apna-host/permissions.ts — PermissionGate with always/session/once\n  scopes, localStorage-backed standing grants, change-event fan-out\n- components/organisms/PermissionPrompt — allow/deny × once/session/always\n  modal, used for both lazy gating and apna.permissions.request batches\n- components/organisms/AppPermissionsSettings + /settings section — list,\n  revoke, emit permissions:changed to open instances\n\nModule Federation design remote (HOST-015/-016)\n- next.config.mjs: webpack.container.ModuleFederationPlugin exposing\n  designRemote at /_next/static/chunks/remoteEntry.js. React/react-dom\n  intentionally NOT shared (Next 14 App Router + MF shared-module hoisting\n  conflicts at runtime — leaf design components render their own subtree)\n- components/design-remote/{Button,Card,Input,Textarea,Avatar,Label}.tsx\n  — curated stable-prop wrappers over components/ui primitives\n- lib/apna-host/design-selections.ts — localStorage store + change subscribe;\n  modals advertise designRemote URL in HandshakeAck and emit design:selections\n\nBuilder (HOST-019/-020)\n- /build landing (choose-a-path) + /build/scaffold (starter picker) +\n  /build/editor (in-browser code + live iframe preview)\n- app/api/build/scaffold/route.ts — zip download endpoint (dep-free PKZIP\n  archive builder in lib/build/zip.ts)\n- lib/build/templates/ — React+Vite + single-HTML + make-compatible guide,\n  all pre-wired to @apna/sdk\n- lib/types/apps.ts: hosting: ''nostr'' | ''url'' (isGeneratedApp kept as a\n  deprecated derived alias); contentEventId for source > 48 KiB\n- MiniAppModal + GeneratedAppModal folded into one loader keyed off hosting\n\nPer-mini-app notifications (HOST-017)\n- app/api/apna/notifications/send/route.ts — POST, NIP-98 authed via\n  nostr-tools/nip98.validateToken, verifies signer pubkey owns a published\n  mini-app metadata note (relay lookup against APPS_ROOT_NOTE_ID), then\n  fans out via pushSubscriptionStore + web-push. In-memory rate limit\n  (30/min/pubkey). 401/403/429/400/500 error codes\n- lib/nostr/nip98Config.ts: apnaNotificationsSend registered\n\nLanding + launcher split (HOST-018)\n- app/page.tsx is now a minimal marketing landing with a Suspense-wrapped\n  useSearchParams redirector: /?appId=… → /app?…\n- Launcher moved to app/app/page.tsx\n- components/AppShell.tsx hides the TopBar on /\n- BottomNav: Home (/app), Explore, Build (new third entry)\n- app/api/manifest/route.ts: start_url + shortcuts → /app\n\nPermission unit tests (HOST-010)\n- lib/apna-host/__tests__/permissions.test.ts — 21 tests covering scope\n  semantics, deny outcomes, revoke flow, listAllPermissions, change events.\n  Runner: Node 22 --experimental-strip-types + node:test (zero new deps)\n- npm test script wired; allowImportingTsExtensions in tsconfig.json\n\nDefensive fixes uncovered during browser smoke\n- nip04Utils.ts + pushSubscriptionStore.ts: guard module-level\n  nip19.decode(SERVER_NPUB) against an undefined env var (was crashing\n  next build)\n- PushNotificationSettings.tsx: guard SERVER_NPUB.slice on the same env var\n- MiniAppModal: iframe element tracked via state-attached callback ref so\n  the per-instance ApnaHost is created AFTER Radix Dialog portals the\n  iframe into the DOM. Without this the handshake silently timed out at 30s\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ae638ce058950a8dd9d4a44f6328f445e1ae2a49","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Apna-HQ/apna-app/git/trees/ae638ce058950a8dd9d4a44f6328f445e1ae2a49"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Apna-HQ/apna-app/git/commits/0b0a30f4b089876f9b33a24c12ad6a1bfe6e17cf","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8403524?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nandubatchu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nandubatchu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nandubatchu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nandubatchu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/nandubatchu","id":8403524,"login":"nandubatchu","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg0MDM1MjQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nandubatchu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nandubatchu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nandubatchu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nandubatchu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nandubatchu/subscript